INSERT INTO `inbound_emails` VALUES ('1ca10295-e539-466b-b905-4a37f2662c98','<CAB7a6wPVUGUOGz8XgZ7kw_OSxvCpF7D_jyL1+mNwSuvoRto8Cw@mail.gmail.com>',7,'INBOX','phyowaiaung.pxyo@gmail.com','phyo wai aung','notifications@dynime.com',NULL,'Re: Application status update: Not selected','<6a101bf9.4c68cf1c.137763.672aSMTPIN_ADDED_BROKEN@mx.google.com>','[\"<6a101bf9.4c68cf1c.137763.672aSMTPIN_ADDED_BROKEN@mx.google.com>\"]','Hi Dynime Team, Thank you for the update. Just a small suggestion — instead of sending a general rejection message like “doesn’t meet the requirements,” it would be more helpful to mention specific reasons or missing qualifications. Based o','Hi Dynime Team,\n\n\nThank you for the update.\n\n\nJust a small suggestion — instead of sending a general rejection message\nlike “doesn’t meet the requirements,” it would be more helpful to mention\nspecific reasons or missing qualifications. Based on the job description,\nmy experience actually matched the listed requirements, so the response\nfelt unclear.\n\n\nThanks, and best wishes.\n\n\nPhyo Wai Aung\n\n\nOn Fri, May 22, 2026 at 4:03 PM Dynime <notifications@dynime.com> wrote:\n\n> Your application status is now Not selected.\n> [image: Dynime logo]\n>\n> Dynime\n> <https://dynime.com>\n>\n> Careers\n> PHYO WAI AUNG, your application was updated\n>\n> Thank you for your interest. After review, we are not moving forward with\n> this application at this time.\n>\n> Latest update\n>\n> Role: Frontend Developer\n>\n> Status: Not selected\n>\n> Updated: May 22, 2026 at 9:03 AM UTC\n>\n> A note from our team\n>\n> Hi PHYO WAI AUNG, Thanks for applying for Frontend Developer.\n> Unfortunately your current profile doesn\'t meet the specific requirements\n> we\'re hiring for at this time. We\'ll keep your details on file for future\n> openings that may be a better fit.\n> ------------------------------\n>\n> If there is a next step, our team will contact you directly by email.\n>\n> — The Dynime Team\n>\n> Copyright © 2026 Dynime.\n>\n> Suite Bd1724 Skyport Drive, Harmondsworth, West Drayton, Middx, England,\n> UB7 0LB, United Kingdom\n>\n> dynime.com\n>\n','<div><div style=\"font-size:inherit\"><div style=\"font-size:inherit\">\n\n<p>Hi Dynime Team,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thank you for the update.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Just a small suggestion — instead of sending a general rejection message like “doesn’t meet the requirements,” it would be more helpful to mention specific reasons or missing qualifications. Based on the job description, my experience actually matched the listed requirements, so the response felt unclear.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks, and best wishes.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Phyo Wai Aung</p>\n\n</div></div><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Fri, May 22, 2026 at 4:03 PM Dynime &lt;<a href=\"mailto:notifications@dynime.com\">notifications@dynime.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204)\"><u></u><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0px;max-width:0px\">Your application status is now Not selected.</div><div style=\"font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0px\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0px auto;padding:32px 28px;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif\"><div style=\"padding:24px 0px 8px;text-align:center;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;margin-bottom:24px;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom-color:rgb(236,238,245)\"><a href=\"https://dynime.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(10,10,20)\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://dynime.com/apple-touch-icon.png\" alt=\"Dynime logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-radius: 10px; display: inlin