 regards On Fri, May 22, 2026, 2:01 PM Dynime <notifications@dynime.com> wrote: > Your application status is now Not selected. > [image: Dynime logo] > > Dynime > <https://dynime.com> > > Careers > Muhammad ','Thank you for your response.\nKind regards\n\nOn Fri, May 22, 2026, 2:01 PM Dynime <notifications@dynime.com> wrote:\n\n> Your application status is now Not selected.\n> [image: Dynime logo]\n>\n> Dynime\n> <https://dynime.com>\n>\n> Careers\n> Muhammad Ali, your application was updated\n>\n> Thank you for your interest. After review, we are not moving forward with\n> this application at this time.\n>\n> Latest update\n>\n> Role: Full Stack Developer\n>\n> Status: Not selected\n>\n> Updated: May 22, 2026 at 9:01 AM UTC\n>\n> A note from our team\n>\n> Hi Muhammad Ali, Thanks for applying for Full Stack Developer.\n> Unfortunately your current profile doesn\'t meet the specific requirements\n> we\'re hiring for at this time. We\'ll keep your details on file for future\n> openings that may be a better fit.\n> ------------------------------\n>\n> If there is a next step, our team will contact you directly by email.\n>\n> — The Dynime Team\n>\n> Copyright © 2026 Dynime.\n>\n> Suite Bd1724 Skyport Drive, Harmondsworth, West Drayton, Middx, England,\n> UB7 0LB, United Kingdom\n>\n> dynime.com\n>\n','<div dir=\"auto\">Thank you for your response.<div dir=\"auto\">Kind regards</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Fri, May 22, 2026, 2:01 PM Dynime &lt;<a href=\"mailto:notifications@dynime.com\">notifications@dynime.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><u></u><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0px;max-width:0px\">Your application status is now Not selected.</div><div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0px\"><div style=\"max-w