hardworking, and capable of working independently while meeting targets and deadlines.\n\nI believe my experience and communication skills would make me a valuable addition to your team. I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nMohammad Rohan','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-24 17:14:11','2026-05-24 17:14:22',46,'medium','[\"social\",\"media\",\"executive\",\"marketing\"]','[\"managing\",\"brand\",\"accounts\",\"copywriting\",\"sense\",\"design\",\"trends\",\"comfortable\",\"buffer\",\"later\",\"notion\",\"growth\"]','Matched 4/16 keywords for \"Social Media & Brand Executive\". Required ~2y, candidate has 6y. While the applicant has extensive experience and some relevant social media management, the primary focus of their experience and cover letter is lead generation and sales, not brand management and social media strategy. This could be a misalignment with the core responsibilities of a \'Social Media & Brand Executive\'. Further investigation during an interview would be needed to assess their brand-focused social media skills and alignment with design/trend understanding for brand-specific content.','2026-05-24 17:14:22',3519,'[\"Lead Generation\",\"Digital Marketing\",\"Outreach & Client Acquisition\",\"Social Media Marketing\",\"eCommerce operations\",\"Facebook group marketing\",\"Appointment setting\",\"Customer handling\",\"Social media page management\",\"Lead generation\",\"Client acquisition\",\"Facebook Group Outreach & Marketing\",\"Social Media Management\",\"Customer Communication & Sales Handling\",\"CRM & Data Management\",\"Content Posting\",\"Basic Content Creation\",\"eCommerce Order & Inventory Management\",\"Website order processing\",\"Order tracking\",\"Social media sales inquiries\",\"Marketing posts\",\"Content creation\",