and some relevant social media management, the primary focus of their experience and cover letter is lead generation and sales, not brand management and social media strategy. This could be a misalignment with the core responsibilities of a \'Social Media & Brand Executive\'. Further investigation during an interview would be needed to assess their brand-focused social media skills and alignment with design/trend understanding for brand-specific content','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"sabbirhossain01846@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801646412554\", \"01646-412554\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://linkedin.com/in/restricted\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://notavailable.com\"]}','[\"Has 6 years of experience, exceeding the 2+ years requirement for managing brand social accounts.\",\"Experience includes managing Facebook and Instagram pages for Tutree Education, creating and publishing social media posts, and engagement content.\",\"Demonstrates strong copywriting with experience in creating marketing posts and content, social media posts, and engagement content.\",\"Mentions creating marketing posts and content, suggesting a sense of design and trends.\",\"Familiarity with various tools, though Buffer/Later/Notion are not explicitly mentioned, the overall technical comfort is evident.\"]'),('05cb02fa-c2dc-416b-b890-782012f117f5','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Sajeda Akter Akhi','242032011@feniuniversity.ac.bd','01886915995','Bangladesh','BSc in CSE Student',1,'$200 USD / monthly',NULL,NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1780165530726-5j2v71.pdf','31 May 2026\n\nHiring Manager\nDynime\n\nSubject: Application for Sales & Growth Executive\n\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am interested in applying for the Sales & Growth Executive position at Dynime. I have experience in sales and customer handling, and I enjoy communicating with people, building relationships, and helping businesses grow