,\"Sales and Marketing\",\"MS-Word\",\"MS-Excel\",\"MS-PowerPoint\",\"Windows\"]','[\"Sales & Growth Executive\",\"Sales Executive\",\"Marketing Sales Executive\",\"Assistant Teacher\"]',0.670000,'B.Sc. Engineering in CSE (Running) from Feni University, Diploma in Engineering in CSE (2023) from FIPI, S.S.C in Humanities (2019) from Feni G A Academy','[\"Only 0.67 years of relevant sales experience, which is significantly less than the 3+ years requirement.\",\"Currently a running B.Sc. student, which indicates limited full-time professional experience.\",\"Stated desire to improve English communication skills, which might be a barrier for an international sales role.\",\"Expected salary ($200 USD/month) is at the lower end of the advertised range, potentially indicating a mismatch in experience or expectations for a sales and growth executive role.\"]','The applicant shows enthusiasm for sales and indicates some relevant skills in digital marketing and sales, alongside a willingness to learn. However, the experience level is well below the stated requirement, and self-identified weaker English communication skills could be a challenge for an international role. Consideration should be given to their potential and teachability, but it\'s important to acknowledge significant gaps in direct experience and communication proficiency for a client-faci','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"242032011@feniuniversity.ac.bd\"], \"github\": [\"Github.com/sajeda897\"], \"phones\": [\"+8801886915995\", \"01886915995\", \"+88 01886915995\", \"242032011\", \"3.75 2023\", \"3.32 2019\"], \"linkedin\": [\"Linkedin.com/Sajeda-Akter1\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"Experience in sales and customer handling.\",\"Goal-oriented with a willingness to learn new skills.\",\"Experience as a Sales Executive at Astha Travels and Tourism (Jan 2026 - Apr 2026) and Camor (Dec 2024 - Jan 2025).\",\"Skilled in Digital Marketing (SEO/SMM).\",\"Expressed enthusiasm for working with an international team and gaining global exposure.\"]'),('072528a2-26dc-4b15-b4b0-933a9f803060','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Zuhaib ul Hassan','zuhaib.u.hassasn@gmail.com','+92 3064944276','Pakistan','Software Engineer @SkilledHat',2,'Negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/zuhaib-ul-hassan/','https://www.zuhaib.online/','public/full-stack-developer/1779683912867-40yk0g.pdf','Dear Recruiter,  \nI am writing to express my interest in the Full Stack Developer position at Dynime. With over 2 years of professional experience, I have developed and maintained production-level solutions used across the U.S. and Canada, building scalable and reliable web applications using .Net, JavaScript, React.js, Angular, C#, SQL/NoSQL databases, and APIs. I also have experience working with GLS US. \nAt SkilledHat, a U.S.-based firm, I contributed to the development and optimization of complex web applications using ASP.NET Core JavaScript, React, and Angular. Working within a distributed Agile team, I delivered production-ready solutions aligned with quality standards and project timelines. Under SkilledHat, I am currently working with GLS US on the production and development of their web applications. In addition, I developed a cross-platform mobile application using React Native, further expanding the product’s reach. Previously, during my internship at KaiRiz Cyber Technologies, I built single-page applications and implemented authentication-based login systems, for which I received a certificate of excellence in recognition of my contributions.\nIn addition to my technical experience, I served as a Technical Lead at GDSC Air University, where I led a team and organized technical workshops to promote collaboration and practical learning. This role strengthened my leadership and communication skills, and further reinforced my commitment to mentorship and solving real-world problems through technology.\nRelocation is not an issue if selected for the role, and I’m fully prepared to adapt to the specific needs of the position. \nWith a strong foundation in web development and a keen ability to work collaboratively and innovate, I am confident that I would be an amazing asset to Dynime I look forward to discussing how my skills and passion can contribute to the continued success of your team.','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-25 04:38:38','2026-05-25 04:38:49',57,'medium','[\"full-stack\",\"react\",\"node\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"code\"]','[\"typescript\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\",\"features\"]','Matched 8/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. The candidate demonstrates strong full-stack web development skills with React, JavaScript, and various databases. While they have strong experience with .NET, their explicit Node.js and TypeScript experience is not highlighted, and they fall short of the 3+ years experience requirement. Their soft skills, including leadership and a product-focused approach, are a plus. Might be a good fit if the backend stack is flexible or if there\'s an opportunity for quick upskilling.','2026-05-25 04:38:49',3086,'[\".NET\",\"JavaScript\",\"React.js\",\"Angular\",\"C#\",\"SQL\",\"NoSQL\",\"APIs\",\"ASP.NET Core\",\"React Native\",\"TypeScript\",\"OOP\",\"Data Structures\",\"Software Engineering Principles\",\"REST APIs\",\"Agile\",\"Vue.js\",\"Git\",\"Bitbucket\",\"Jira\",\"Azure DevOps\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Python\",\"MySQL\",\"MS SQL Server\",\"MongoDB\",\"Firebase\",\"Microsoft Azure\",\"Docker\",\"Solidity\",\"Metamask\",\"Web3.js\",\"Node.js\",\"DevOps\"]','[\"Full Stack Developer\",\"Software Engineer\",\"Junior Software Engineer\",\"Web Development Intern\",\"Technical Lead\",\"Internee\"]',2.000000,'Bachelor of Computer Sciences (BSCS)','[\"Job post requires 3+ years of full-stack TypeScript experience, but the candidate only has 2 years of overall experience and does not explicitly mention TypeScript in their skills or experience.\",\"The primary backend experience listed is .NET, whereas the job post specifically mentions Node.js.\"]','The candidate demonstrates strong full-stack web development skills with React, JavaScript, and various databases. While they have strong experience with .NET, their explicit Node.js and TypeScript experience is not highlighted, and they fall short of the 3+ years experience requirement. Their soft skills, including leadership and a product-focused approach, are a plus. Might be a good fit if the backend stack is flexible or if there\'s an opportunity for quick upskilling.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"zuhaib.u.hassasn@gmail.com\", \"zuhaib.u.hassan@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+92 3064944276\", \"+92 306 4944276\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zuhaib-ul-hassan/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://www.zuhaib.online/\", \"zuhaib.online\"]}','[\"2 years of professional experience in full-stack development, building and maintaining production-level solutions.\",\"Experience with React, Angular, and JavaScript, widely used front-end technologies.\",\"Contributed to production systems used across the US and Canada while at SkilledHat.\",\"Developed a cross-platform mobile application using React Native.\",\"Experience with SQL and NoSQL databases.\",\"Familiarity with Agile development, CI/CD tools (Git, Bitbucket, Jira, Azure DevOps), and cloud platforms (Microsoft Azure).\",\"Demonstrated leadership as a Technical Lead at GDSC Air University, organizing workshops and mentoring.\",\"Received a certificate of excellence for contributions during an internship at KaiRiz Cyber Technologies.\"]'),('08452b92-648c-4957-9dad-ee4d1652e7b3','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Zain Ahmad Khan','k05340092@gmail.com','9