], \"portfolio\": [\"https://zainkhanniazi.netlify.app/\"]}',NULL),('08efb449-d91a-45ff-a5c1-05b5d35b5f69','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Ibraheem Mudasser','ibt.ibraheem@gmail.com','+92 320-8465338','Pakistan','Frontend Developer',2,'35000','https://www.linkedin.com/in/ibraheem-mudasser-0401a4265/','https://ibraheem-mudasser.vercel.app/','public/frontend-developer/1779265121644-cum8h7.pdf','I’m a Frontend Developer with 2+ years of experience building scalable, responsive, and performance-focused web applications using React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI.\n\nWhat makes me a strong fit for this role is my experience working on real-world production dashboards and business applications where clean UI, responsiveness, reusable components, and attention to detail were essential. I’ve developed admin panels, booking systems, and multi-role platforms with integrations such as REST APIs, Firebase, WebSockets, CRUD operations, and localization.\n\nI have hands-on experience translating designs into responsive and user-friendly interfaces while maintaining performance and scalability. I also focus on writing clean, maintainable code and creating reusable frontend architectures that improve development efficiency.\n\nAt Whetstonez, I collaborated on frontend applications that supported real business operations, which helped strengthen my problem-solving, teamwork, and frontend engineering skills.\n\nI’m passionate about modern frontend development, UI/UX, and building polished digital experiences, and I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute to Dynime’s team and products.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 08:18:42','2026-05-22 09:01:20',67,'medium','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\"]','[\"desig