m.totl.football\", \"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ir-nu-metric-suite/id1607680879\"]}','[\"Over 5 years of experience in frontend and full-stack development, with strong expertise in React.js, Next.js, and TypeScript.\",\"Proficient in Tailwind CSS and has experience with Material-UI and Ant-design, indicating design-systems experience.\",\"Worked on various complex projects including AI-driven tools, healthcare platforms, CRM systems, and marketplace platforms, showcasing a breadth of experience.\",\"Demonstrates strong attention to detail and ability to translate Figma designs into production-ready interfaces.\",\"Experienced with performance optimization, responsive design, and deployment, which are crucial for Web Vitals.\",\"Mentored junior developers and participated in code reviews, showing leadership and collaboration skills.\",\"Experience with real-time functionalities using Socket.io and Twilio integration for communication features.\",\"Comfortable with component architecture, state management (Redux, Context API), API integrations (REST, GraphQL), authentication, and debugging.\"]'),('0d1a8c45-e3b6-4b59-ab94-a83396cc93da','36546ce3-4900-4ae4-a5f4-16c17cca146f','qa-testing-executive','QA & Testing Executive','Muhammad zain khan','mohammadzainkhan48@gmail.com','03122264165','pakistan','JUNIOR SQA ENGINEER',2,'$80000 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/zain-khan-8b2408203/','https://github.com/zain400/Testing-Projects','public/qa-testing-executive/1779538070418-0qty0q.pdf','QA Engineer Position\n\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to apply for the QA Engineer . With over two years of experience in manual testing for web and mobile applications, I am confident that my skills in functional, regression, API, and UAT testing will bring immediate value to your team.\n\nAt A Tech Site LLC, I have been responsible for end-to-end manual testing of SaaS and FinTech applications, including workflow validation, UI testing, role-based permissions, and data accuracy. I use JIRA and ClickUp for defect tracking, Postman for API validation, and SQL queries for backend data verification. My detailed bug reports and clear reproduction steps have helped development teams resolve issues faster.\n\nPreviously at Saro Shop, I executed over 80 test cases per cycle, performed cross-browser and mobile testing, and collaborated closely with developers in Agile sprints to ensure high-quality releases.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to contribute to [Company Name]\'s success. I am available for an interview at your earliest convenience and look forward to discussing how my QA experience aligns with your needs.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nZain Khan','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-23 12:07:53','2026-05-23 12:08:02',60,'medium','[\"one\",\"tool\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"testing\"]','[\"hands-on\",\"least\",\"automation\",\"istqb\",\"executive\",\"technical\"]','Matched 5/11 keywords for \"QA & Testing Executive\". Required ~2y, candidate has 2y. The applicant meets the experience requirement and demonstrates strong manual QA skills, JIRA, Postman, and SQL. However, they lack explicit mention of hands-on experience with an automation tool, which is a key requirement.','2026-05-23 12:08:01',2757,'[\"manual testing\",\"web applications\",\"mobile applications\",\"functional testing\",\"regression testing\",\"API testing\",\"UAT testing\",\"SaaS\",\"FinTech applications\",\"workflow validation\",\"UI testing\",\"role-based permissions\",\"data accuracy\",\"JIRA\",\"ClickUp\",\"Postman\",\"SQL queries\",\"bug reporting\",\"cross-browser testing\",\"Agile\",\"Scrum\",\"STLC\",\"SDLC\",\"Integration Testing\",\"Smoke Testing\",\"System Testing\",\"ERP Workflow Testing\",\"UI/UX Testing\",\"Test Case Design\",\"Defect Lifecycle\",\"Input Validation Testing\",\"Role & Permissio