r improved workflow visibility and transparency.\",\"Assisted in issue tracking, reporting, and quality monitoring.\",\"Collaborated effectively in a remote environment using tools like ClickUp and Google Meet.\",\"Developed a MERN-stack accounting and inventory management application (Digital Khata).\",\"Performed rigorous manual testing on critical modules of projects.\",\"Built a QR-based restaurant ordering system utilizing the MERN stack (QRDER).\",\"Conducted extensive testing on user interaction flows and responsive UI behavior.\",\"Developed responsive frontend features and components for an E-commerce website and resolved UI/usability inconsistencies.\",\"Certified in Practical Software Testing and Software Testing & QA.\",\"Has foundational knowledge of Linux (Ubuntu basics).\"]'),('1980ca03-48de-41b0-9e45-d183c6aad633','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','samiya aishy','samiyaneel4@gmail.com','+8801786254439','Bangladesh','Data Scraper',1,'Negotiable',NULL,NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1779819548018-7vu5va.pdf',NULL,'career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; CPH2825 Build/BP2A.250605.015; wv) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/148.0.7778.175 Mobile Safari/537.36 [FB_IAB/FB4A;FBAV/562.0.0.51.73;IABMV/1;]','2026-05-26 18:19:04','2026-05-28 14:25:50',21,'low','[\"international\",\"executive\",\"growth\",\"remote\",\"grow\"]','[\"b2b\",\"sales\",\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"self-driven\",\"remote-ready\",\"development\",\"hiring\",\"want\",\"global\",\"career\",\"dynime\",\"relationships\",\"drive\",\"careers\"]','Matched 5/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 1y. The applicant does not meet the minimum experience requirements for international B2B sales. While they have remote experience and some international client exposure in data entry and content roles, they lack d