ed website content and structure to improve search rankings, conducted keyword research, and enhanced organic traffic through effective on-page SEO strategies.\",\"Published expert automotive content for an Australian car rental site, focusing on SEO optimization and engaging 2-day rapid project delivery.\",\"Strategized digital content delivery and optimized business workflows, ensuring high-quality engagement and efficient resource management.\"]'),('1a041578-637f-40de-a6c1-980bf44f3b7a','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Rohan Asif','rohanasif1990@gmail.com','+923134614022','Pakistan','Mern stack developer',3,'$100000/yr negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/rohan-asif/','https://rohanasif.vercel.app','public/full-stack-developer/1779216054986-n1d8p2.pdf','Hi, I\'m Rohan Asif — a full-stack developer passionate about building scalable, user-centric web applications.\nWith hands-on experience across the MERN/PERN stacks, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI, I’ve developed everything from SaaS platforms to admin dashboards and eCommerce sites. I specialize in creating responsive frontends and robust backend APIs with clean, maintainable code.\nI’m seeking a full-time opportunity where I can contribute to high-impact products, collaborate with talented teams, and continue growing as a developer.\nTech Stack Highlights:\n✅ React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, MUI\n✅ Node.js, Express, MongoDB, PostgreSQL\n✅ REST APIs, Auth (JWT/OAuth), Prisma/Sequelize\nLet’s connect if you’re looking for someone who delivers fast, high-quality solutions and thrives in collaborative environments.\nPortfolio: rohanasif.vercel.app\nGitHub: github.com/rohanasif','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-19 18:40:58','2026-05-22 09:01:39',78,'high','[\"full-stack\",\"typescript\",\"react\",\"node\",\"postgres\",\"full\",