sif\"], \"phones\": [\"+923134614022\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rohan-asif/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://rohanasif.vercel.app\", \"rohanasif.vercel.app\", \"task-io-eight.vercel.app\"]}','[\"3+ years full-stack TypeScript experience across MERN/PERN stacks (React, Node, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Next.js, Express, Prisma, Sequelize).\",\"Proficient in React, Node, and PostgreSQL, directly aligning with job requirements.\",\"Experience with CI/CD (GitHub Actions, Vercel) and Docker, demonstrating comfort with cloud and deployment processes.\",\"Strong product mindset demonstrated through delivering client-led UI revisions, improving SEO scores, and focusing on user satisfaction.\",\"Experience with building scalable web applications for thousands of users/month.\",\"Reduced deployment issues by 50% by integrating CI/CD.\",\"Boosted testing coverage to 90% with Jest, reducing production bugs.\",\"Decreased page load times by 40% through optimization.\",\"Enhanced accessibility compliance by integrating modern UI libraries like MUI.\"]'),('1a1b12c8-e18a-4e92-b51e-0cf67552f3b6','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Arpita Das','piud81456@gmail.com','01753444610','Bangladesh','Sales and Growth Executive',6,'$300 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/arpita-das-piu-b74a99379?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android','https://www.linkedin.com/in/arpita-das-piu-b74a99379?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android','public/international-sales-executive/1780098322221-l5cjht.pdf','Dear Concern,\n\nMy name is Arpita. I am applying for the position Sales and Growth Executive.I am seeking a remote opportunity and have been working remotely since 2023, primarily within the gaming industry.\n\nI have over 6 years of professional experience, including 2023- 2026 experience in the gaming industry as a Senior Telemarketing Executive and Team Leader. My expertise includes customer service handling, agent training, sales operations, lead conversion, KYC verification, bonus and incentive management, and various administrative and managerial responsibilities. I have also been actively involved in team supervision, performance tracking, reporting, and daily operational support.Recently i had worked with another company As a Remote chat support agent.\n\nFurther details are available in my resume. I would be grateful for the opportunity to contribute my leadership, sales, and operational experience to your organization. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nSincerely,\nArpita Das\nBangladesh','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; RMX5555 Build/BP2A.250605.015) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/148.0.7778.175 Mobile Safari/537.36 [FB_IAB/FB4A;FBAV/562.0.0.51.73;IABMV/1;]','2026-05-29 23:45:23','2026-06-08 05:59:27',51,'medium','[\"sales\",\"executive\",\"growth\",\"remote\",\"want\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"career\"]','[\"international\",\"b2b\",\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"self-driven\",\"remote-ready\",\"development\",\"hiring\",\"dynime\",\"relationships\",\"drive\",\"careers\"]','Matched 8/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 6y. While the applicant has a good duration of experience and is open to remote work, there are significant inconsistencies in the stated employment dates and durations. The IELTS score is modest, and direct international B2B sales experience is not clearly articulated. Further clarification on her recent work history and actual international sales exposure would be needed.','2026-06-08 05:59:27',3534,'[\"customer service handling\",\"agent training\",\"sales operations\",\"lead conversion\",\"KYC verification\",\"bonus and incentive management\",\"administrative responsibilities\",\"managerial responsibilities\",\"team supervision\",\"performance tracking\",\"reporting\",\"daily operational support\",\"chat support\",\"Telemarketing\",\"Education Consultant\",\"CRM\",\"Executive-Sales Associate\",\"Acting Officer-in-Charge - Executive & Sales\",\"Executive Officer\",\"MS-Word\",\"MS-Power Point\",\"Canva\",\"Internet\",\"communication\",\"migration management\",\"interpersonal skill\",\"analytical\",\"problem-solving\",\"innovative thinking\",\"Self-confidence\",\"Persuasive\",\"influencing skills\",\"Team leading\",\"Well Organized\"]','[\"Sales and Growth Executive\",\"Senior Telemarketing Executive\",\"Team Leader\",\"Remote chat support agent\",\"Executive-Sales Associate\",\"Education Consultant\",\"Acting Officer-in-Charge - Executive & Sales\",\"Executive Officer\",\"Sr. Telemarketing Executive\"]',6.000000,'Bachelor of Science (B.Sc. Hons) in Botany from National University, Higher Secondary Certificate (H.S.C) in Science from Rajshahi Govt. City College, Secondary School Certificated (S.S.C) in Science from Govt. PN Girls High School.','[\"Salary expectation of $300 USD / monthly is at the higher end of the stated range ($150-$300).\",\"Experience dates for \'Senior Telemarketing Executive and Team Leader\' and \'Sr. Telemarketing Executive\' from the resume (2024-2024 and 2025-2025) are either future dates or refer to a short duration, conflicting with the stated \'6 years\' of experience and \'2023-2026\' in the cover letter.\",\"The cover letter mentions \'2023- 2026 experience in the gaming industry\' which seems like a broad or future-dated claim.\",\"The most recent job listed in the resume for specific dates is \'Sr. Telemarketing Executive\' from 2025 (future date), which creates ambiguity about current employment.\",\"IELTS score of 5.5 is not particularly strong for an \'International Sales Executive\' role requiring excellent communication.\",\"No explicit mention of international B2B sales experience, only \'working with international clients\' in general terms.\",\"Some listed job durations are very short (e.g., SS Global & Tours: 3 months, Glorious Consultancy: 3 months).\"]','While the applicant has a good duration of experience and is open to remote work, there are significant inconsistencies in the stated employment dates and durations. The IELTS score is modest, and direct international B2B sales experience is not clearly articulated. Further clarification on her recent work history and actual international sales exposure would be needed.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"piud81456@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"01753444610\", \"+8801753444610\", \"2023- 2026\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/arpita-das-piu-b74a99379?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/arpita-das-piu-b74a99379?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\"]}','[\"6 years of professional experience, including remote work since 2023.\",\"Experience in sales operations, lead conversion, and customer service handling.\",\"Team leadership and supervisory experience.\",\"B.Sc. Hons graduate, indicating educational background.\",\"Proficient in Bangla and English, with an IELTS score of 5.5.\",\"Expressed interest in remote opportunities and has relevant experience.\",\"Previous experience as \'Education Consultant\' and \'Executive-Sales Associate\' aligns with client interaction.\"]'),('1a8e8bd6-6dab-4a10-b2ac-162c0a643bf8','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Umaima Shahid','umaima.shahid2023@gmail.com','+923254246932','Pakistan','Full Stack Developer (Student) @ FAST-NUCES',2,'Negotiable','https://linkedin.com/in/umaima-shahid/','https://my-cv-nine-xi.vercel.app','public/full-stack-developer/1779212001605-18eukf.pdf','I\'m currently in my 6th semester at FAST-NUCES and I won\'t pretend I have years of work experience, but I\'ve spent the last couple of years building real full-stack applications that go beyond typical university projects.\nThe one most relevant here is Fynder, a platform I built to solve a real problem at my university: students struggling to find FYP teammates. It\'s a full MERN stack app with real-time chat, a compatibility scoring engine, JWT auth, and AI-assisted features, deployed on Vercel. I made architectural decisions on it like using Hexagonal architecture to keep the business logic clean and testable, not because it was required, but because it was the right call.\nI\'m comfortable jumping between React components and backend APIs, thinking about database schemas, and caring about how the end product actually feels to use. I pick things up fast and I take code quality seriously.\nI know the listing says 3+ years of experience. I don\'t have that on paper, but I think the work shows where I\'m at. I\'d love the chance to prove that.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-19 17:33:23','2026-05-22 09:01:43',69,'medium','[\"full-stack\",\"react\",\"node\",\"comfort\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"code\",\"features\"]','[\"typescript\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\"]','Matched 10/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. Despite being a student and having less than the stated 3+ years of experience, Umaima\'s projects demonstrate strong practical skills in a modern full-stack environment (MERN), a clear product mindset, and an understanding of architectural principles. The lack of explicit TypeScript and PostgreSQL experience is a gap, but her fast learning ability and code quality focus make her a promising candidate. Consider an interview to assess her ability to adapt to TypeScript and pick up Postgres/Supabase.','2026-05-19 17:33:36',4475,'[\"Python\",\"JavaScript\",\"C#\",\"x86 Assembly\",\"SQL\",\"C++\",\"React.js\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"ASP.NET Core 8\",\"Flask\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"OpenCV\",\"face_recognition (dlib)\",\"128-D facial embeddings\",\"REST AI APIs\",\"MongoDB Atlas\",\"SQLite\",\"Entity Framework Core\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"JWT\",\"Bcrypt\",\"Postman\",\"Vercel\",\"Socket.io\",\"Figma\",\"Flutter\",\"Hexagonal architecture\"]','[\"Full Stack Developer\"]',2.000000,'Bachelor of Science in Computer Science, FAST National University of Computer & Emerging Sciences (Expected Graduation: June 2027)','[\"The applicant\'s stated experience (2 years as Full Stack Developer, currently a student) is below the 3+ years full-stack TypeScript requirement.\",\"While React and Node are present, direct experience with Postgres or Supabase is not explicitly mentioned; MongoDB is the primary database in projects.\",\"Explicit mention of TypeScript experience is not present; JavaScript is listed.\"]','Despite being a student and having less than the stated 3+ years of experience, Umaima\'s projects demonstrate strong practical skills in a modern full-stack environment (MERN), a clear product mindset, and an understanding of architectural principles. The lack of explicit TypeScript and PostgreSQL experience is a gap, but her fast learning ability and code quality focus make her a promising candidate. Consider an interview to assess her ability to adapt to TypeScript and pick up Postgres/Supabas','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"umaima.shahid2023@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/umaimaa-shahid\"], \"phones\": [\"+923254246932\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://linkedin.com/in/umaima-shahid/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://my-cv-nine-xi.vercel.app\"]}','[\"Strong experience with React, Node.js, and MongoDB (MERN stack), aligning with requested technologies, though Postgres/Supabase is not explicitly mentioned.\",\"Demonstrated ability to build, deploy, and maintain full-stack applications through projects like Fynder and SmartPresence.\",\"Fynder showcases end-to-end feature development, real-time communication (Socket.io), authentication (JWT), and AI integration.\",\"Architectural decision-making demonstrated with Hexagonal (Ports & Adapters) architecture in Fynder, indicating a strong understanding of software design principles.\",\"Comfortable with CI/CD concepts implicitly through Vercel deployment and understanding of testing.\",\"Strong product mindset evident in solving real-world problems (Fynder for university teammates) and focusing on user experience.\",\"Experience with database schemas (MongoDB, SQLite, Entity Framework Core) and backend API development (Flask, Express.js, ASP.NET Core).\",\"Has experience collaborating and participating in technical decisions and code quality (mentioned in cover letter and project descriptions).\"]'),('1aa7bbc9-e7db-4e64-b088-39306f3d4d7b','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Taqadas Ur Rehman','taqadasurrehman@gmail.com','+923127014219','Pakistan','Full stack Front End Developer',3,'$60/yr','https://www.linkedin.com/in/taqadas-urrehman',NULL,'public/frontend-developer/1779258457844-ordkry.pdf','Hello,\nI’m interested in the WordPress Developer position.\n\nMy name is Taqadas Ur Rehman, and I have 3+ years of hands-on experience in WordPress development, including custom theme development, plugin development, website optimization, and responsive frontend implementation.\n\nMy expertise includes:\n\nCustom WordPress development using PHP, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap, and React , ReactJS, NideJs, Selvte. \n\nBuilding and customizing themes from scratch\n\nDeveloping and maintaining custom plugins\n\nElementor, Divi, Beaver Builder, WP Bakery, and ACF\n\nWebsite optimization, migration, and CMS customization\n\nClean and maintainable coding practices\n\nI have worked on multiple live business and agency projects, including:\n\nhttps://metix.co\n\nhttps://tapfire.io\n\nhttps://sciotoflooring.com\n\nhttps://instituteofpediatricsleep.com\n\nhttps://design-x-web.netlify.app\n\nhttps://tdelectricwny.com\n\nhttps://schoolconex.com\n\nhttps://riversdaleacademy.com\n\nMy WordPress plugin:\nhttps://ur.wordpress.org/plugins/tr-pixel-engine/\n\nLinkedIn:\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/taqadasurrehman\n\nI would be happy to complete the application form and provide any additional information required.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nBest regards,\nTaqadas Ur Rehman','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 06:27:42','2026-05-22 09:01:26',59,'medium','[\"react\",\"css\",\"web\",\"vitals\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"understanding\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 7/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate has a strong background in frontend development, particularly with React and an understanding of Web Vitals. However, the application seems to be tailored for a WordPress role, and specific requirements like TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and design-systems experience are not explicitly mentioned in the provided text. Further investigation or clarification would be needed to assess the full fit for the Frontend Developer role.','2026-05-20 06:27:54',5100,'[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"WordPress\",\"PHP\",\"JavaScript\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"Bootstrap\",\"ReactJS\",\"NodeJs\",\"Next.js\",\"WooCommerce\",\"Elementor\",\"ACF\",\"CPT\",\"REST API\",\"MySQL\",\"Figma\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"VS Code\",\"npm\",\"Vercel\",\"Canva\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Web Vitals\",\"Core Web Vitals\",\"PageSpeed Optimization\",\"Technical SEO\",\"Image Optimization\",\"Caching\",\"CDN\",\"Schema Basics\",\"AI-assisted coding\",\"ChatGPT workflows\",\"content/SEO automation\",\"prompt-based debugging\",\"workflow optimization\"]','[\"Full stack Front End Developer\",\"WordPress Developer\",\"AI-Enhanced WordPress Developer\",\"Full Stack Frontend Developer\",\"Project Manager\"]',3.000000,'Bachelor\'s Degree in Computer Science - Riphah International University, Lahore | 2020 - 2024','[\"The cover letter explicitly states interest in a \'WordPress Developer position\', which is not the advertised \'Frontend Developer\' role, suggesting a potential mismatch or generic application.\",\"No explicit mention of TypeScript experience, which is a key requirement.\",\"No explicit mention of Tailwind CSS or design-systems experience, which are key requirements.\",\"While attention to detail is claimed implicitly through quality work, it is not explicitly demonstrated in the submission related to the job post\'s specific requirements.\"]','The candidate has a strong background in frontend development, particularly with React and an understanding of Web Vitals. However, the application seems to be tailored for a WordPress role, and specific requirements like TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and design-systems experience are not explicitly mentioned in the provided text. Further investigation or clarification would be needed to assess the full fit for the Frontend Developer role.','{\"other\": [\"https://schoolconex.com\"], \"emails\": [\"taqadasurrehman@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923127014219\", \"+92 312 7014219\", \"2020 - 2024\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/taqadas-urrehman\", \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/taqadasurrehman\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://metix.co\", \"https://tapfire.io\", \"https://sciotoflooring.com\", \"https://instituteofpediatricsleep.com\", \"https://design-x-web.netlify.app\", \"https://tdelectricwny.com\", \"https://schoolconex.com\", \"https://riversdaleacademy.com\", \"https://ur.wordpress.org/plugins/tr-pixel-engine/\", \"https://taqadasurrehman.me\"]}','[\"3+ years of experience, aligning with the job requirement.\",\"Strong experience with React.js, matching the primary technical skill.\",\"Understanding and mention of Core Web Vitals, directly addressing a job requirement.\",\"Experience in building and customizing themes/plugins, and website optimization applicable to frontend development.\",\"Publicly available WordPress plugin and client project links provided.\"]'),('1b08bbaf-f1a9-4ef2-b94c-c4e8ac7d2b2c','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Abdul Basit','abdulbasitria@hotmail.com','+923155232477','Pakistan','Senior Software Engineer',6,'Negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/abdul-basit-sse/','https://ab-abdul-basit.netlify.app/','public/frontend-developer/1779573428683-ay1uka.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Senior Frontend Developer position. With over six years of professional experience in software development, specializing in React.js, Next.js, React Native, TypeScript, and modern frontend technologies, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nThroughout my career, I have built scalable, high-performance web and mobile applications with a strong focus on user experience, performance optimization, and clean architecture. I have extensive hands-on experience developing complex frontend systems using React.js and Next.js, creating responsive and highly interactive user interfaces, optimizing application performance, and implementing reusable component-driven architectures.\n\nIn addition to frontend expertise, I have significant experience in React Native, where I have developed cross-platform mobile applications with seamless user experiences across Android and iOS platforms. My work includes API integrations, real-time functionality, state management, push notifications, analytics integration, crash reporting, and app deployment processes.\n\nI am also experienced with backend and full-stack technologies including Node.js, Express.js, GraphQL, Firebase, Supabase, and SQL/NoSQL databases, enabling me to collaborate effectively across the entire development lifecycle. Furthermore, I have worked extensively with cloud and DevOps technologies such as AWS, Azure, CI/CD pipelines, Storybook, Monorepo architecture, and multilingual application support.\n\nAs a Senior Frontend Developer, I bring not only strong technical expertise but also problem-solving abilities, collaboration skills, and experience working in fast-paced agile environments. I am passionate about writing clean, maintainable code and building products that deliver exceptional user experiences.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my background and expertise can contribute to your team’s success. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nSincerely,\nAbdul Basit','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-23 21:57:11','2026-05-23 21:57:32',80,'high','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"detail\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"css\",\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"understanding\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 8/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 6y. Abdul Basit is a highly experienced Senior Software Engineer with a strong background in frontend development, particularly with React, Next.js, and TypeScript, aligning well with the job requirements. His experience with Tailwind CSS, design systems (MUI, AntD, Styled Components), and CI/CD pipelines is a strong asset. The candidate also demonstrates a focus on performance optimization and user experience, which often correlates with an understanding of Web Vitals and accessibility, though these are not explicitly detailed. His extensive portfolio of projects further solidifies his candidacy.','2026-05-23 21:57:32',5936,'[\"React.js\",\"Next.js\",\"React Native\",\"TypeScript\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"MUI\",\"AntD\",\"Styled Components\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"GraphQL\",\"Firebase\",\"Supabase