 and full-stack technologies including Node.js, Express.js, GraphQL, Firebase, Supabase, and SQL/NoSQL databases.\",\"Experience with cloud and DevOps technologies such as AWS, Azure, CI/CD pipelines, Storybook, Monorepo architecture.\",\"Proven ability to improve frontend architecture with a monorepo, increasing code readability and streamlining onboarding by 50%.\",\"Experience with testing frameworks including Jest, RTL, and Cypress.\",\"Strong focus on user experience, performance optimization, and clean architecture.\",\"Spearheaded the development of a Carbon Tracking Platform, improving data accessibility for over 50 stakeholders and enhancing decision-making for sustainability initiatives.\",\"Engineered a scalable e-commerce platform using Next.js, improving page load speed by 40% and boosting SEO rankings by 25% through server-side rendering (SSR).\"]'),('1b602c9b-9138-41ad-8b70-9acf4b9c03e4','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Iqra Aslam','hafizaiqraaslam1@gmail.com','03354342983','Lahore','Full Stack Developer',2,'80k','https://www.linkedin.com/in/iqraaslam1','https://myportfolio-rouge-iota-86.vercel.app','public/full-stack-developer/1779284632823-ueqwfd.pdf','Iqra Aslam\n+92 335 4342983\nhafizaiqraaslam1@gmail.com\nPortfolio: https://myportfolio-rouge-iota-86.vercel.app\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/iqraaslam1\nGitHub: https://github.com/Iqra1Aslam\n\nDate: May 11, 2026\n\nHiring Manager\nDatum Labs\n\nSubject: Application for Full Stack Developer Position\n\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am applying for the Full Stack Developer position at Datum Labs. I am a Full Stack Developer with experience in building scalable web and mobile applications using the MERN stack, React Native, and modern JavaScript technologies.\n\nI have developed a Ride Sharing application using React Native, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB, where I implemented authentication, ride management, real-time notifications using Firebase Cloud Messaging, and location-based features. I also have experience working with REST APIs, Socket.IO, and Firebase. In addition, I have built full-stack projects like Countfizz and TaxQuickly using Next.js, focusing on API integration, performance optimization, and responsive UI development.\n\nI am confident that my experience in both frontend and backend development, along with my ability to quickly adapt to new technologies, makes me a strong fit for your team. I am available to join within 10–15 days.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nIqra Aslam','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 13:45:19','2026-05-22 09:03:52',57,'medium','[\"full-stack\",\"react\",\"node\",\"cloud\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"features\"]','[\"typescript\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"mindset\",\"code\"]','Matched 9/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. The candidate has strong full-stack development skills across various technologies including React, Node.js, and Next.js, and experience with modern tools. However, the candidate\'s stated experience is 1 year which does not meet the 3+ years requirement, and there is no explicit mention of TypeScript or Postgres/Supabase experience that are core to the role. The candidate\'s experience with mobile applications (React Native) and AI/Blockchain is a plus.','2026-05-20 13:45:34',3433,'[\"Full-Stack Developer\",\"React Native\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"MongoDB\",\"FastAPI\",\"LLMs\",\"Next.js\",\"React\",\"Solana\",\"MERN stack\",\"gamified quizzes\",\"voice-based interactions\",\"form autofill\",\"Gemini AI\",\"Pexels API\",\"credit-based usage tracking\",\"Rust\",\"Anchor framework\",\"Web3.js\",\"dApp\",\"RESTful APIs\",\"Redux\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Framer Motion\",\"Nodemailer\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"JavaScript\",\"Socke