.\",\"Proficient in TypeScript, PostgreSQL, and various other database technologies.\",\"Experience with microservices, REST APIs, and cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure, though AWS explicitly mentioned in skills).\",\"Comfortable with CI/CD concepts implied by experience in deploying production-ready features and working with tools like Docker and AWS.\",\"Strong collaboration skills with PM, design, and QA teams.\",\"Experience in developing and maintaining scalable backend services and building full-stack applications.\",\"Knowledge of testing tools like Jest and Cypress.\",\"Expressed strong interest in contributing to impactful projects and growing in a fast-paced environment, aligning with a product mindset.\"]'),('2575f207-3f7a-4817-8661-a13068d095ee','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Ahmed Younas','ahmedyounas007@outlook.com','+923125824019','Pakistan','Founding Software Engineer',3,'$500 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/ahmed-younas-360b481a5','https://www.ahmedyounas.space/','public/full-stack-developer/1779469588247-is74m0.pdf','I’ve been working as a Full Stack Developer for around 3 years now, mostly with React, Next.js, Node.js, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, and cloud services. Right now I’m working as a Founding Software Engineer where I handle both frontend and backend work, ship features, work on APIs, deployments, integrations, and pretty much everything needed to get products running properly in production.\n\nWhat interested me in this role is that you’re looking for someone who can actually build and ship things end to end instead of just working on one small part. That’s the type of work I enjoy the most. I like moving fast, solving problems, improving systems, and building products that people actually use daily.\n\nI’m also comfortable with CI/CD, cloud environments, GitHub workflows, and working with teams on product decisions and implementation. I care more about building real 