ependently while meeting targets and deadlines.\n\nI believe my experience and communication skills would make me a valuable addition to your team. I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nMohammad Rohan','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-24 17:13:15','2026-05-24 17:13:25',21,'low','[\"relationship\",\"communication\",\"services\",\"outreach\",\"executive\",\"sales\"]','[\"partnerships\",\"networker\",\"builder\",\"written\",\"verbal\",\"saas\",\"partnership\",\"development\"]','Matched 6/14 keywords for \"Partnership & Outreach Executive\". Required ~2y, candidate has 6y. The applicant has extensive experience in lead generation, cold outreach, and client acquisition, which are valuable for an outreach role. However, the alignment with \'Partnerships\' is less clear, and the discrepancy in stated experience years versus education timeline is a significant concern that requires immediate clarification. The lack of a visible LinkedIn profile or portfolio showing partnership-specific work also limits assessment. If the experience discrepancy can be resolved positively, the candidate\'s skills in communication and outreach could be a good fit for the \'Outreach Executive\' part of the role.','2026-05-24 17:13:25',3519,'[\"B2B lead generation\",\"prospect list building\",\"cold outreach\",\"appointment setting\",\"lead closing\",\"lead research\",\"cold emailing\",\"LinkedIn outreach\",\"CRM management\",\"sales communication\",\"social media marketing\",\"eCommerce operations\",\"Facebook group marketing\",\"customer handling\",\"social media page management\",\"B2C Lead Generation\",\"Client Acquisition\",\"Facebook Group Outreach\",\"Social Media Management\",\"Data Management\",\"Content Posting\",\"Basic Content Creation\",\"eCommerce Order Management\