.\"]'),('27cedd7f-a91e-439e-9154-dcac9a5440b1','615bd905-4368-42e1-9675-b90206409cfa','technical-support-executive','Technical Support Executive','Arpan Neupane','arpanarpan360@gmail.com','+9779846952971','Nepal','QA Learner',NULL,'Negotiable','https://linkedin.com/in/arpan-neupane11','https://www.arpan-neupane.com.np/','public/technical-support-executive/1779611184645-eje4rs.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\nI am a Computer Engineering student with practical experience in software testing, web development, and project-based problem solving. Through academic and personal projects, I have gained hands-on exposure to web development (mostly MERN Stack), AI, Networking, Project Management, SDLC/STLC concepts and testing methodologies.\nI have worked on projects involving inventory management systems, QR-based ordering systems, and various responsive web applications, where I contributed to frontend development, testing, issue tracking, and workflow coordination. These experiences helped me understand both the technical and user-side aspects of software quality and usability.\nIn addition to development and testing, I am familiar with operating system, tools and technologies such as Windows, Linux(Ubuntu basics), MongoDB, Postman, Git/GitHub, JIRA, and Trello. I am interested in opportunities where I can continue developing my technical skills, gain real industry experience, and contribute positively within a collaborative team environment.\nThank you for your time and consideration. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and learning mindset can support your team.\nSincerely,\nArpan Neupane','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-24 08:26:26','2026-05-24 08:26:35',50,'medium','[\"technical\",\"support\",\"basic\",\"code\",\"english\",\"familiar\",\"front\"]','[\"comfort\",\"reading\",\"logs\",\"written\",\"intercom\",\"zendesk\",\"executive\"]','Matched 7/14 keywords for \"Technical Support Executive\". While the candidate demonstrates strengths in technical skills, web development, and QA, there is a lack of direct evidence for the 2+ years of technical support experience, familiarity with log reading, and the specified support platforms (Intercom/Zendesk/Front). The candidate\'s background leans more towards software development and testing rather than customer-facing technical support. If technical support experience is flexible, his strong technical foundation could be valuable. Further inquiry regarding his technical support experience and familiarity with the mentioned tools is recommended.','2026-05-24 08:26:35',2529,'[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"JavaScript\",\"React.js\",\"MongoDB\",\"SQL\",\"Manual Testing\",\"Functional Testing\",\"Regression Testing\",\"Test Case Design\",\"API Testing\",\"SDLC\",\"STLC\",\"Bug Reporting\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"Postman\",\"JIRA\",\"Trello\",\"ClickUp\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Windows\",\"Linux\",\"MERN Stack\",\"web development\",\"software testing\",\"Quality Assurance\",\"UI/UX\",\"Project Management\",\"frontend development\",\"inventory management systems\",\"QR-based ordering systems\"]','[\"QA Learner\",\"Project Management Trainee\",\"Computer Engineering student\"]',NULL,'Bachelor in Computer Engineering','[\"No explicit mention of experience with Intercom, Zendesk, or Front.\",\"No explicit mention of reading logs.\",\"Experience years not provided, but implies some project and internship experience.\",\"No direct evidence of 2+ years of technical support experience per job requirements.\",\"Focus is more on QA and development rather than dedicated technical support.\"]','While the candidate demonstrates strengths in technical skills, web development, and QA, there is a lack of direct evidence for the 2+ years of technical support experience, familiarity with log reading, and the specified support platforms (Intercom/Zendesk/Front). The candidate\'s backgroun