lity. However, the discrepancies in the experience dates are a significant red flag that requires immediate clarification.','{\"other\": [\"LeetCode\"], \"emails\": [\"mkashan2912@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923458032912\", \"+92 3458032912\", \"2025 - 09\", \"2024 - 08\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-kashan-ashraf/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://itzkashan.dev/\"]}','[\"Proficient in a wide array of programming languages and web development technologies, including TypeScript, React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL, directly aligning with job requirements.\",\"Extensive experience in both frontend (React, NextJS) and backend (Node.js, Express, MongoDB, PostgreSQL) development.\",\"Multiple projects explicitly mention building features end-to-end, demonstrating experience across the stack.\",\"Mentions working with Figma designs and achieving pixel-perfect implementation, showcasing attention to detail and ability to collaborate with design.\",\"Experience with Redis, Kafka, Queues, DevOps, Kubernetes, and Scalable Architecture Design indicates comfort with CI/CD and cloud concepts, along with performance considerations.\",\"The cover letter explicitly mentions a focus on pixel-perfect frontend design and ensuring backend stability under traffic spikes, indicating a strong product mindset for quality and performance.\",\"Despite having 3 years of reported experience, the timeline for \'Junior Software Engineer\' and \'Full Stack Intern\' roles (08/2025-09/2025 and 06/2024-08/2025 respectively) suggests future-dated employment or potential discrepancies in dates, which needs clarification.\"]'),('2a99526d-c70d-42b9-812a-a7640c52b2db','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Moiz Habibullah','khatrimoiz86@gmail.com','+923102804030','Pakistan','Full Stack Developer Intern',1,'60k','https://www.linkedin.com/in/moiz-khatri-52334b276?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_and