 \'4 years\', the resume dates indicate a start date of April 2022, which is closer to 2 years and 8 months. This discrepancy should be clarified.\"]','The candidate presents a strong match for the Full Stack Developer role due to extensive experience with React, Node.js, and full-stack development, exceeding the minimum experience requirement. While direct experience with Postgres/Supabase is not explicitly stated, the candidate\'s strong database design and MongoDB experience suggests a high potential for quick adaptation. Further inquiry regarding Postgres/Supabase experience and clarification on total years of experience is recommended.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"fahadjawad596@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/fahadjawad\"], \"phones\": [\"+923346919102\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/fahad-jawad\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://fahad-jawad-portfolio.vercel.app/\"]}','[\"Has 4 years of experience as a Full Stack Developer, exceeding the 3+ years requirement.\",\"Strong experience with React and Node.js, directly aligning with job requirements.\",\"Experience with full-stack TypeScript, as stated in the cover letter and implied by the Next.js and frontend work.\",\"Familiarity with CI/CD workflows, demonstrated in past roles and listed in technical skills.\",\"Experience in designing scalable database schemas and working with MongoDB, indicating potential adaptability to Postgres/Supabase.\",\"Mentions a \'product mindset\' in the cover letter, aligning with the job description.\",\"Extensive experience in developing new features across the stack and participating in code reviews and technical decisions.\",\"Portfolio and project experience showcase end-to-end feature development and user-facing applications.\"]'),('2c8b0910-9ace-4746-9bb7-78dc3fa85a06','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Nusrat Mithila','nusratmithila66@gmail.com','+8801998095688','Bangladesh','FMSS Specialist',2,'Negotiable