 3900890','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-24 15:11:21','2026-05-24 15:11:33',73,'high','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"understanding\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"design-systems\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 11/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. The candidate demonstrates strong potential and a solid foundation in frontend development, particularly with React and related technologies. While their direct experience with TypeScript and overall tenure is slightly below one of the explicit requirements (3+ years React + TypeScript), their stated \'working knowledge\' of TypeScript and continuous learning mindset may bridge this gap. Their experience with Tailwind CSS, design systems, and attention to detail aligns well with other requirements. Given the slightly lower experience, an interview would be valuable to assess their depth of knowledge and practical application of TypeScript, Web Vitals, and accessibility.','2026-05-24 15:11:33',3016,'[\"React.js\",\"JavaScript\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Responsive Web Design\",\"UI/UX Design\",\"GSAP\",\"ScrollTrigger\",\"REST APIs\",\"Python\",\"FastAPI\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"VSCode\",\"CursorAI\",\"SQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"Bootstrap\",\"YOLO\",\"Data Cleaning\",\"Data Preprocessing\",\"Data Analysis\",\"Pandas\",\"Dashboards\",\"Visual Reports\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"Web Application Developer\",\"Assistant UI/UX Developer\",\"Data Science & Analytics Intern\",\"Junior Web Developer\",\"Backend Developer Intern\"]',2.000000,'Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering, Sir Syed University of Engineering & Technology (SSUET), 2020-2024','[\"The required experience for React + TypeScript is 3+ years, but the candidate states 2+ years of experience with Re