ions, combined with my ability to adapt, learn fast, and work independently, allows me to contribute effectively to sales growth and client satisfaction. I am highly motivated, target-driven, and capable of representing a company professionally in global markets.','career-page','shortlisted',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 26_4_1 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Mobile/23E254 Safari/604.1 [FBAN/FBIOS;FBAV/562.0.0.61.70;FBBV/974804325;FBDV/iPhone18,2;FBMD/iPhone;FBSN/iOS;FBSV/26.4.1;FBSS/3;FBID/phone;FBLC/en_US;FBOP/5;FBRV/978690395;IABMV/1]','2026-05-25 04:20:11','2026-05-28 12:59:25',73,'high','[\"international\",\"sales\",\"executive\",\"development\",\"growth\",\"remote\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"career\",\"drive\"]','[\"b2b\",\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"self-driven\",\"remote-ready\",\"hiring\",\"want\",\"dynime\",\"relationships\",\"careers\"]','Matched 10/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. Afsana Bhuyian presents a strong profile for the International Sales Executive role, especially given her remote experience with US-based clients and proven sales, communication, and relationship-building skills. Her multilingual ability and self-driven nature align well with the job requirements. The career gap focused on exploring postgraduate studies in Canada also provided exposure to customer-facing retail environments, which could be seen as additional relevant experience.','2026-05-25 04:20:21',3632,'[\"Client Relationship Management\",\"Patient Coordination\",\"Healthcare Operations Support\",\"Project Coordination\",\"Telesales and Marketing\",\"Reporting & Documentation\",\"Data Analysis\",\"Research Methodology\",\"Statistical Analysis\",\"Requirements Gathering\",\"Process Improvement\",\"Service Delivery Monitoring\",\"CRM Operations\",\"Issue Resolution\",\"Cross-functional Coordination\",\"Outbound calls\",\"Lead generation\",\"Customer engagement\",\"Sales progress tracking\",\"Collaboration\",\"Customer service\",\"Negotiation\",\"Relationship building\",\"Client satisfaction\",\"MS Word\",\"MS Excel\",\"PowerPoint\",\"Google Workspace\",\"AutoCAD\",\"ETABS\",\"Google Earth Pro\",\"Bengali\",\"English\"]','[\"Telesales Executive\",\"Client Relation Executive\",\"Associate Professor\",\"Information Resources Manager\"]',3.000000,'B.Sc. in Bioinformatics – 2022 | Asian University for Women; HSC in Science – 2017 | Cantonment Public School and College; SSC in Science – 2015 | Bangladesh Mahila Samity Girls High School and College','[\"The stated salary of $150-$300/month is very low for an \'International Sales Executive\' role, which might indicate a mismatch in expectation for the applicant or an unusually low compensation for the recruiter\'s side. However, the applicant listed \'Negotiable\' and did not flag this as an issue.\"]','Afsana Bhuyian presents a strong profile for the International Sales Executive role, especially given her remote experience with US-based clients and proven sales, communication, and relationship-building skills. Her multilingual ability and self-driven nature align well with the job requirements. The career gap focused on exploring postgraduate studies in Canada also provided exposure to customer-facing retail environments, which could be seen as additional relevant experience.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"afsanabhuyian1997@gmail.com\", \"moniruzzaman.mollah@auw.edu.bd\", \"jobayer@softwaresolutions360.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801610203098\", \"01610203098\", \"+88 01610203098\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/afsana79\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"3 years of experience, including remote international B2B sales (Telesales Executive, Client Relation Executive).\",\"Proficiency in client relationship management, negotiation, and communication skills applicable to international sales.\",\"Experience working with US-based clients and digital platforms, demonstrating remote work capability and cultural awareness.\",\"Strong communication and relationship-building skills highlighted in both cover letter and work experience.\",\"Motivated and target-driven, with a focus on sales growth and client satisfaction.\",\"Multilingual abilities (Bengali, English) are an asset.\",\"Demonstrated ability to work independently and remotely.\"]'),('33af101d-1d11-441a-87ef-384c0c32aacc','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Muneeb Hassan','muneebxhasan@gmail.com','+923009456842','Pakistan','Ai Automation Engineer',3,'$50k/year','https://www.linkedin.com/in/muneebxhasan/','https://www.muneebhassan.me/','public/full-stack-developer/1779257930150-lq8lda.pdf','Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am a CS student about to graduate with close to three years of hands on experience across freelance work and full time roles. I am applying for the Full Stack Developer position at Dynime and I believe the work I have shipped makes me a strong fit.\n\nA good chunk of that experience has come from freelancing, where I worked with different clients and tech stacks, figured things out independently, and delivered without much hand holding. More recently I have been working full time at Benji as an AI Automation Engineer and before that at BedsChain as a Full Stack Developer. That mix of freelance and product work has made me comfortable owning features end to end.\n\nOn the frontend I work with React, Next.js, and TypeScript. On the backend I use Node, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL, designing APIs, handling auth, and managing deployments through GitHub Actions CI/CD on Azure and Vercel.\n\nAt Benji I built LLM powered automation workflows and integrated AI agents into production backend systems. At BedsChain I worked on an internal booking platform handling real time availability, secure auth, and reservation workflows. My event driven microservices project covers async patterns, PostgreSQL schema design, and containerised deployments with Docker.\n\nI write clean, tested code, collaborate well with design and product, and take real ownership of what I build.\n\nmuneebhassan.me — github.com/muneebxhasan\n\nThank you for your time.\n\nMuneeb Hassan','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 06:18:51','2026-05-21 16:58:37',35,'low','[\"typescript\",\"react\",\"node\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"code\",\"features\"]','[\"full-stack\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\",\"technical\"]','Matched 11/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. Strong candidate due to direct technology stack match, relevant experience, and demonstrated product mindset. The discrepancy in experience dates should be clarified.','2026-05-20 06:19:01',2380,'[\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Node\",\"Postgres\",\"Supabase\",\"CI/CD\",\"Python\",\"n8n\",\"VAPI\",\"LLM\",\"GPT\",\"Claude\",\"GitHub Actions\",\"Azure\",\"Vercel\",\"Kafka\",\"Docker\",\"Kong API Gateway\",\"FastAPI\",\"LiveKit\",\"LangGraph\",\"AWS\",\"GCP\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"JavaScript\",\"SQL\"]','[\"AI Automation Engineer\",\"Full Stack Developer\"]',3.000000,'Bachelor of Science in Cybersecurity','[\"Graduating in July 2026, which might indicate current enrollment rather than completed degree.\",\"Current role as \'AI Automation Engineer\' and recent past role as \'Full Stack Developer\' at BedsChain (Sep 2025 – Feb 2026) suggests very recent full-stack experience, but the AI role started Jan 2026, which is inconsistent with the BedsChain end date. This could be a typo in the dates.\"]','Strong candidate due to direct technology stack match, relevant experience, and demonstrated product mindset. The discrepancy in experience dates should be clarified.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"muneebxhasan@gmail.com\", \"muneebxhasan@email.com\", \"envelopemuneebxhasan@email.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/muneebxhasan\"], \"phones\": [\"+923009456842\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/muneebxhasan/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://www.muneebhassan.me/\", \"muneebhassan.me\"]}','[\"3 years of experience across freelance and full-time roles, aligning with the 3+ years requirement.\",\"Strong proficiency in React, Node, and PostgreSQL, directly matching the core tech stack.\",\"Experience with TypeScript on the frontend (React, Next.js).\",\"Comfortable with CI/CD and cloud platforms (GitHub Actions, Azure, Vercel, AWS, GCP).\",\"Demonstrates a strong product mindset, emphasizing end-to-end feature ownership and collaboration with design/PM.\",\"Mentions writing clean, tested, performant code.\",\"Experience in building and deploying features across the full stack.\",\"Contributed to building a booking system, indicating experience with complex applications.\",\"Experience with microservices, asynchronous patterns, and Docker, showcasing advanced backend skills.\"]'),('352060dd-19c4-4737-8735-a850f15443d5','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Md Wahed Alam','gabwa.online@gmail.com','+8801731605506','Bangladesh','Customer Service Executive',7,'$300 USD / monthly',NULL,NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1779645058513-sxu04s.pdf','I believe I would be a strong fit for this role due to my extensive experience in administrative support, HR coordination, and working with international remote teams. I have over 7 years of professional experience supporting operations, employee communication, coordination, and client-facing tasks in fast-paced remote environments.\n\nI have worked with USA and UK-based organizations, which has helped me develop strong communication, teamwork, and cross-cultural collaboration skills. My IELTS Band 8.0 reflects my ability to communicate professionally and confidently in English with international clients and team members.\n\nIn addi