rience in translating designs to code strongly suggests familiarity with design systems, though specific mention of Tailwind CSS is absent. Further inquiry on Web Vitals and accessibility would solidify the fit.','2026-05-25 13:11:57',4059,'[\"React\",\"React Native\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"REST API\",\"Redux\",\"React Query\",\"Zustand\",\"Node.js\",\"Express\",\"MongoDB\",\"Problem Solving\",\"Git\",\"Jira\",\"Bitbucket\",\"Cursor\",\"Copilot\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Next.js\",\"Expo\",\"USPS APIs\",\"Web Vitals\",\"a11y\"]','[\"Senior Frontend Engineer\",\"Senior Software Engineer\"]',5.000000,'Bachelor in Computer Science — PAF KIET (08/2018 – 01/2022)','[\"While design-to-code precision is mentioned, explicit experience with \\\"Tailwind CSS and design-systems\\\" is not directly stated, though implied.\",\"Understanding of \\\"Web Vitals and a11y\\\" is mentioned in the job description but not explicitly highlighted or demonstrated in the submission, although performance optimization experience is present.\"]','Strong candidate. Matches or exceeds most technical requirements with extensive experience in React/TypeScript, strong architectural skills, and a focus on quality and performance. The candidate\'s experience in translating designs to code strongly suggests familiarity with design systems, though specific mention of Tailwind CSS is absent. Further inquiry on Web Vitals and accessibility would solidify the fit.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"saqlain11000@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923352309015\", \"+92 335 2309015\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammad-saqlain-ali/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://mohammadsaqlain.netlify.app/\"]}','[\"Over 5 years of experience in React and React Native ecosystem, exceeding the job requirement of 3+ years.\",\"Specializes in building and scaling production-grade web and mobile applications.\",\"Experience with complex third-party API integrations, including USPS logistics and rea