ed a medical application supporting multiple user roles using React, Redux, and React Query.\",\"Built dynamic interfaces with React and managed application state using Zustand.\",\"Experience in team leadership and mentoring junior engineers.\",\"Implemented testing with Jest and Cypress to ensure 95% code coverage.\"]'),('40990ffc-720a-444c-97f7-730a77475377','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Muhammad Muneeb Shahid','muneebshahid7169@gmail.com','+923027169070','Pakistan','Senior Frontend Developer ( React , Next.js)',2,'140k','https://www.linkedin.com/in/m-muneeb-shahid-mern','https://www.linkedin.com/in/m-muneeb-shahid-mern','public/frontend-developer/1779274471777-4w7xrv.pdf','M. Muneeb Shahid\nLahore, Pakistan\nEmail: muneebshahid7169@gmail.com | Phone: +92 302-7169070\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/m-muneeb-shahid-mern\n\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am applying for a Frontend Developer role. I have hands-on experience in JavaScript, TypeScript, React.js, and Next.js, along with working knowledge of Node.js and Express.js. I build responsive, scalable, and performance-focused web applications.\n\nIn my current role as a Senior Frontend (MERN) Developer, I develop user interfaces, integrate REST APIs, and ensure cross-browser compatibility. I work with Tailwind CSS and Material UI to create clean and reusable components. I also contribute to backend APIs and deployment workflows using Docker and GitHub Actions.\n\nPreviously, I worked as a Frontend Developer using Next.js and TypeScript, where I converted UI/UX designs into production-ready applications. I focused on code quality, performance optimization, and maintainability.\n\nMy key skills include React.js, Next.js, JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, REST APIs, Git, Docker, and responsive design. I am comfortable working in agile teams and delivering reliable solutions.\n\nI hold a Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering and continue