t practices.\",\"Provided multiple project links, showcasing practical application of skills.\"]'),('4289c58e-2a48-45e1-90ea-0e8323bb70bc','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Muhammad Ali','alimuhammadghouri0@gmail.com','+923121531106','Pakistan','Software Engineer',3,'180k pkr','https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-ali1122?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android','https://portfolioo-muhammadali.vercel.app/','public/full-stack-developer/1779256359385-ryauri.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager, \nI am writing to express my keen interest in the position advertised at your esteemed organization. As a Full \nStack Developer with over two years of experience in building high-performance web applications using the \nMERN stack and modern JavaScript frameworks, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your \ndevelopment team and help deliver scalable, user-centric solutions. \nIn my current role at Altaurux, I have led the development of production-ready applications using Next.js, React.js, Node.js, and Tailwind CSS. I’ve engineered real-time features with WebSockets, integrated secure payment gateways like Stripe and Revolut, and deployed applications using CI/CD pipelines on DigitalOcean and Heroku. My contributions have improved database query performance by 30% and reduced deployment times by 40%. I’m passionate about writing clean, maintainable code and delivering software that drives real business value. \nBeyond my technical skills, I bring a collaborative mindset and agile experience, having worked closely with cross-functional teams, designers, and product managers to ensure alignment and timely delivery. My work on platforms like Model Haus, Swoopseats, and Safra Travel demonstrates my ability to lead full-stack \ninitiatives from architecture to deployment, always prioritizing performance, security, and user experience. \nI would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my