58:35',34,'low','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"web\",\"vitals\",\"frontend\",\"developer\"]','[\"design-systems\",\"understanding\",\"a11y\",\"technical\"]','Matched 10/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 4y. The candidate\'s experience and skills align very well with the job requirements, demonstrating strong proficiency in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. The cover letter highlights specific achievements in component library development, performance optimization, and UI quality, directly addressing key aspects of the role. The only concern is the unparseable resume, but the cover letter provides significant detail.','2026-05-20 08:00:40',13011,'[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Figma\",\"Core Web Vitals\",\"SSR optimization\",\"bundle tuning\",\"component systems\",\"accessibility standards\",\"performance-first development\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"Frontend Engineer\"]',4.000000,'','[\"Resume/CV text is unparseable.\"]','The candidate\'s experience and skills align very well with the job requirements, demonstrating strong proficiency in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. The cover letter highlights specific achievements in component library development, performance optimization, and UI quality, directly addressing key aspects of the role. The only concern is the unparseable resume, but the cover letter provides significant detail.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"zainhiranij@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923092378789\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-zain-a9956b234/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://zain-dev.lovable.app/\"]}','[\"4+ years of experience building production-grade web applications in React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.\",\"Experience shipping pixel-perfect UIs from Figma, optimizing Core Web Vitals, and building reusable component systems.\",\"Built a shared TypeScript component library of 30+ co