ion to performance and accessibility is mentioned, specific knowledge of \'Web Vitals\' is not explicitly stated.\"]','Despite the discrepancy in experience timeline and the slightly lower experience years than required, the candidate demonstrates strong alignment with required skills (React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS) and understanding of key concepts like attention to detail, performance, and accessibility. Their project portfolio and leadership experience as an intern are positive. Recommend for preliminary interview to clarify experience timeline and depth of knowledge in Web Vitals and specific design system','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"khatrimoiz86@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923102804030\", \"0310-2804030\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/moiz-khatri-52334b276?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://moizkh3.vercel.app/\"]}','[\"Proficient in React and TypeScript, aligning with job requirements.\",\"Experienced with Tailwind CSS and design systems (implicitly through building UI/UX focused projects).\",\"Demonstrated strong attention to detail through projects focusing on intuitive user interfaces, performance, accessibility, and responsive design.\",\"Explicitly mentions attention to performance and accessibility, which relates to Web Vitals and a11y understanding.\",\"Actively involved in full-stack development, showing a broader understanding of web application architecture.\",\"Led development of large-scale internal projects and mentored other developers.\",\"Has a portfolio with relevant projects showcasing frontend skills.\",\"Expressed enthusiasm for the company\'s focus on scalable SaaS products and UI/UX excellence.\"]'),('4ff4aa90-e081-47cf-88a0-98d8e57fdb89','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Abdul Rehman','rehmanmaliik455@gmail.com','+923099177008','Pakistan','Frontend engineer',2,'Negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/abdul-rehman-aa0966233/',NULL,'public/frontend-developer/1779552213908-p3ovu9.pdf','I am writing to express my strong interest in the Frontend Engineer position. With nearly two years of experience across the MERN stack , I specialize in building highly responsive web and mobile applications using React.js and React Native.\n\nIn my current role at Interlink Engineering, I translate complex Figma designs into clean, production-ready code while handling backend integrations. My portfolio includes high-impact, live projects such as an FBR Digital Invoicing System managing daily operations for 200+ invoices , a Pharmaceutical Serialization Platform ensuring strict regulatory compliance , and NFC-based digital authentication systems.\n\nEquipped with a BS in Computer Science from DHA Suffa University and solid expertise in JavaScript, Tailwind CSS, and state management , I am ready to deliver seamless UI experiences and efficient data flows for your team.','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-23 16:03:38','2026-05-23 16:03:50',67,'medium','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\"]','[\"design-systems\",\"understanding\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\",\"technical\"]','Matched 9/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. The candidate shows strong foundational skills in React and Tailwind CSS, with relevant project experience. While their direct experience with React and TypeScript specifically falls slightly below the stated 3+ years and TypeScript skill is basic, their project work and overall frontend experience are highly relevant. They demonstrate a strong understanding of design implementation and API integration. Consider for an interview, focusing on their TypeScript capabilities and depth of experience with React to assess fit.','2026-05-23 16:03:50