\"Experience with API integrations and contributing to full-stack development.\",\"Developed a GIS-based property verification system using React.js and .NET.\",\"Working on a pharmaceutical serialization platform utilizing React.js and Tailwind CSS.\",\"Delivered an FBR Digital Invoicing dashboard integrated with FBR APIs.\",\"Worked on a restaurant management platform (Tapppp) and an NFC-based digital business card application (NFC Biz).\"]'),('53dc31c1-1f41-4151-a5ca-0c96c24a9c51','409d8470-b829-471c-a16a-7db87f6f86b5','ui-ux-designer','UI/UX Designer','Gaurav Singh Panwar','gauravsinghpanwar@gmail.com','+919636999997','India','UX Lead',8,'$25k/year','https://www.linkedin.com/in/gauravspanwar/','https://gauravspanwar.medium.com/','public/ui-ux-designer/1779350854001-btymqp.pdf','Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI’m writing to express my interest in the UI/UX Designer role.\n\nWith 8+ years of experience in product and UX design, I’ve worked extensively on SaaS platforms, enterprise systems, and AI-driven products, focusing on transforming complex workflows into intuitive and scalable user experiences. This aligns closely with your requirement of designing elegant interfaces from research through high-fidelity delivery.\n\nIn my current role as a UX Lead, I drive end-to-end design processes including user research, usability testing, wireframing, prototyping, and final UI delivery in Figma. I have hands-on experience designing dashboards, onboarding flows, and data-heavy interfaces, ensuring clarity, usability, and visual consistency across products.\n\nI’ve also built and maintained design systems, collaborated closely with product managers and engineering teams, and continuously iterated designs based on user feedback and business goals. My approach combines strong visual design fundamentals—typography, color, and hierarchy—with a deep focus on usability and product thinking.\n\nI’m particularly interested in this role because of its focus on SaaS product design, ownership 