ibute and add value from day one.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nM. Muneeb Shahid','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 11:18:14','2026-05-21 16:58:31',28,'low','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"understanding\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 8/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate meets most of the core requirements for the Frontend Developer role, including significant experience with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. The listed experience with design systems (Tailwind CSS, Material UI, Shadcn, Headless UI) and focus on performance suggests a good fit. The discrepancy in the start date for the current role needs clarification, but overall, the profile is strong.','2026-05-20 11:18:25',3655,'[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Next.js\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"MongoDB\",\"Material UI\",\"Docker\",\"GitHub Actions\",\"Git\",\"REST APIs\",\"Responsive Design\",\"React Query\",\"Context API\",\"Fetch API\",\"Axios\",\"WebSockets\",\"SQL Server\",\"Postman\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Shadcn\",\"Headless UI\",\"AOS\",\"Jira\",\"ECR\",\"ECS\",\"SSH Deploy Key\",\"PM2\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"Senior Frontend (MERN) Developer\"]',3.000000,'Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering, National Textile University, Faisalabad, Punjab, Pakistan (Sep 2021 - June 2025)','[\"The resume indicates current role at \'Venre\' starting June 2025, which appears to be a future date and may be a typo or incorrect information, given the current year is 2024.\"]','The candidate meets most of the core requirements for the Frontend Developer role, including significant experience with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. The listed experience with design systems (Tailwind CSS, Material UI, Shadcn, Headless UI) and focus on performance suggests a good fit. The discrepancy in the start date for the current role needs clarification, but overall, the profile is strong.','{\"other\": [\"https://www.dkajatax.com/\", \"https://www.aiguaroca.com/\", \"https://www.campalink.com/\", \"https://fenzro.vercel.app/\", \"https://www.dremxconstruction.com/\", \"https://womixoll.vercel.app/\", \"https://www.venre.org/\", \"https://icpmarketingapp.vercel.app\", \"https://my-blogs-eta.vercel.app/\"], \"emails\": [\"muneebshahid7169@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923027169070\", \"+92 302-7169070\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/m-muneeb-shahid-mern\", \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/m-muneeb-shahid-mern?\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://www.aiguaroca.com/\", \"https://www.campalink.com/\", \"https://fenzro.vercel.app/\", \"https://www.dremxconstruction.com/\", \"https://womixoll.vercel.app/\", \"https://www.venre.org/\", \"https://icpmarketingapp.vercel.app\", \"https://my-blogs-eta.vercel.app/\"]}','[\"Has 3 years of experience as a Frontend Developer.\",\"Proficient in React and TypeScript.\",\"Experienced with Tailwind CSS and Material UI.\",\"Demonstrates an understanding of responsive and performance-focused web applications.\",\"Experience with Next.js, Node.js, and Express.js.\"]'),('5751b0b8-e01e-47df-a1bc-5a9965d2d18e','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','ZUBAIR RAFIQ','h.m.zubairrafiq@gmail.com','+923030609872','Pakistan','Full Stack Developer',4,'$14/hr','https://www.linkedin.com/in/zubair-rafiq-62121b185/','https://zubair-portfoli0.vercel.app/','public/full-stack-developer/1779280582695-cg2yg2.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\nI am writing to express my interest in the Full Stack Engineer position at Dynime. With over three years of experience delivering production-grade web applications across Fintech and SaaS domains, I bring both the technical depth and the execution discipline that enterprise engineering teams demand.\nIn my current role at Bashin Technologies, I architect Microservices-based backend systems handling real-time financial transactions across distributed databases in the UAE and KSA. Previously, as the sole backend developer on EarlyPay — a PCI-compliant Earned Wage Access platform — I independently integrated multi-bank linking, AI-driven credit risk scoring, and automated payroll deduction logic from the ground up.\nWhat drives me is building systems that are not just functional, but reliable at scale. Whether it is designing secure payment gateway flows, synchronizing large datasets through Google Ads API, or managing high-concurrency APIs with Redis and ClickHouse — I take ownership of the full delivery, not just my slice of it.\nI would welcome the opportunity to bring that same standard to Dynime and contribute to your engineering goals.\nYours sincerely,\nZubair Rafiq','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 12:36:38','2026-05-21 16:58:29',33,'low','[\"full-stack\",\"typescript\",\"react\",\"node\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"cloud\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"features\"]','[\"comfort\",\"mindset\",\"code\"]','Matched 12/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 4y. Strongly recommend for further consideration. The candidate\'s experience and technical stack are an excellent match for the Full Stack Developer role, particularly their expertise in React, Node, PostgreSQL/Supabase, and a strong product mindset. The future date for current employment needs clarification.','2026-05-20 12:36:50',4843,'[\"Node.js\",\"Nest.js\",\"Express.js\",\"REST APIs\",\"Microservices\",\"Webhooks\",\"JWT/Auth\",\"Next.js\",\"React.js\",\"TypeScript\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"ShadCN UI\",\"Material UI\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MySQL\",\"MongoDB\",\