\",\"Record Maintenance\",\"Email Handling\",\"Internet Browsing\",\"Call Centre\",\"Customer Service\",\"File Management\",\"Documentation\",\"C Programming\",\"cold calling\",\"professional call management\",\"client communication\"]','[\"Computer Science & Engineering student\",\"Business Coordinator\",\"Office Support\",\"Volunteer\"]',NULL,'Bachelor of Science in Computer Science & Engineering (CSE) from East West University, Dhaka','[\"Applicant explicitly states being a \'fresher\' and having no prior experience, which directly conflicts with the job requirement of \'3+ years international B2B sales\'.\",\"The applicant\'s stated expected salary ($2400 USD / yearly) is significantly higher than the job post\'s stated salary ($150–$300/month, which is $1800-$3600 yearly, but this is a red flag in terms of mismatch of expectations for a junior candidate).\",\"The applicant\'s background is primarily in computer science and support roles, not sales, especially not international B2B sales.\",\"The applicant is seeking a \'part-time Business Coordinator / Office Support position\' which is different from an International Sales Executive role.\"]','Reject','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"kausarahmed0207@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801797072174\", \"01797-072174\"], \"linkedin\": [], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"Currently a Computer Science and Engineering student at East West University.\",\"Seeking a part-time Business Coordinator / Office Support position.\",\"Participated in a 6-Day Intensive Program for Customer Service & Call Management, acquiring skills in cold calling, effective customer handling, and professional call management.\",\"Developed a Student Information Management System using C Programming.\",\"Assisted in organizing coding workshops and events as a volunteer for the EWU Programming Club.\",\"Possesses skills in MS Office Suite, Data Entry, Email Handling, and Customer Service readiness.\"]'),('59e28c4c-a20c-4a82-a8ed-4db207d0619a