responsive UI components.\",\"Build reusable, scalable UI components using Tailwind CSS.\",\"Optimize performance, accessibility, and cross-browser compatibility.\",\"Collaborate with backend and QA teams in Agile sprints, participating in code reviews and planning.\"]'),('5b1b3c73-c5f1-4d35-99a7-e8c8ce84f3ba','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Syed Nabeel Ahmed','nagraphics556@gmail.com','0311 2365715','pakistan','Full Stack Developer',2,'Negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/nabeel-ahmed-24a950217/',NULL,'public/full-stack-developer/1779551482094-en4bud.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI hope you are doing well. I am writing to apply for the Full Stack Developer position at Dynime. I have strong interest in web development and experience in building responsive and user-friendly applications using modern technologies.\n\nI am skilled in frontend and backend development, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, and database management. I am passionate about creating efficient solutions and continuously improving my technical skills.\n\nI believe my dedication, problem-solving abilities, and teamwork skills make me a strong candidate for this role. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to Dynime and grow as a developer within your company.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\n\nSincerely,\nSyed Nabeel Ahmed','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-23 15:51:24','2026-05-23 15:51:35',57,'medium','[\"react\",\"node\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"code\",\"features\"]','[\"full-stack\",\"typescript\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\"]','Matched 8/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. The candidate has relevant full-stack skills an