 2+ years.\",\"Strong hands-on experience with an automation tool (Selenium - Java) mentioned in both resume and cover letter.\",\"Demonstrates strong attention to detail through various testing types (functional, regression, UI, smoke, end-to-end, positive/negative, cross-browser, AI chatbot testing) and documentation skills (test plans, cases, reports).\",\"Experienced in Agile/Scrum environments and SDLC/STLC.\",\"Proficient with key industry tools including Postman, Jira, and various testing types.\",\"Has specific experience in AI Chatbot testing, a specialized and valuable skill.\"]'),('5c615494-31ff-4da2-bc1f-829851f1bd3e','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Syed Talha Jan','syedtalha497@gmail.com','+92 347 8523450','Pakistan','Full stack developer at Metaklouds',5,'$900 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/syed-talha-093005189?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android','https://www.linkedin.com/in/syed-talha-093005189?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android','public/full-stack-developer/1779834103875-sc2z6c.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Full Stack Developer position. With 4+ years of experience building scalable web applications across AI platforms, healthcare systems, and enterprise solutions, I bring strong expertise in React.js, TypeScript, Node.js, Python, FastAPI, MongoDB, and PostgreSQL.\n\nI have led and delivered multiple end-to-end projects, including AI-powered platforms, real-time communication systems, and modern admin panels, focusing on performance, scalability, and clean user experiences. My experience working closely with product, design, and engineering teams has helped me turn complex ideas into production-ready solutions.\n\nI am passionate about building impactful products and would love the opportunity to contribute my technical skills and leadership experience to your team.\n\nI look forward to discussing how I can add value to your organization.\n\nSincerely,\nSyed Talha Jan','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-26 22:21:47','2026-05-28 12:55:55',82,'high','[\"typescript\",\"react\",\"node\",\"postgres\",\"cloud\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"code\",\"features\"]','[\"full-stack\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"mindset\"]','Matched 11/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 5y. Syed Talha Jan is a strong candidate for the Full Stack Developer position, demonstrating significant experience with the required front-end and back-end technologies (React, Node.js, TypeScript). While the resume primarily highlights MongoDB for database experience, the cover letter does mention PostgreSQL. This discrepancy should be clarified during the interview process. His background in leading end-to-end projects and collaborating with product and design teams aligns well with the \'product mindset\' requirement.','2026-05-28 12:55:55',7411,'[\"React.js\",\"TypeScript\",\"Node.js\",\"Python\",\"FastAPI\",\"MongoDB\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Next.js\",\"JavaScript\",\"Redux\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Material UI\",\"Responsive Design\",\"Express.js\",\"NestJS\",\"REST APIs\",\"WebSockets\",\"Microservices\",\"JWT Authentication\",\"OAuth Integrations\",\"Mongoose\",\"Beanie ODM\",\"Database Design\",\"Retell AI\",\"Pydantic AI\",\"LLM workflows\",\"Google Maps API\",\"Google Sign-In\",\"Postmark\",\"GCS\",\"Cognito\",\"S3\",\"HealthLake\",\"Google Cloud Run\",\"Git\",\"Agile\",\"Scrum\",\"Playwright\",\"API Documentation\",\"Vite\"]','[\"Full Stack Developer\",\"Full Stack Engineer\",\"Project Lead\",\"Full stack developer\"]',5.000000,'Bachelor of Science (B.S.) — Computer Science CECOS University, Peshawar, Pakistan Sep 2018 – Sep 2022','[\"The job post explicitly requests Pos