h TypeScript in multiple projects.\",\"Familiarity with CI/CD and cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud).\",\"Demonstrated product mindset through leading end-to-end projects and collaborating with product and design teams.\",\"Experience shipping production code and working end-to-end on features.\",\"Mentions writing clean, tested, performant code.\"]'),('5c97637b-1933-424a-a3c7-1341095e32a4','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','B.M. Jayad Bin Ashik','bmjayad224@gmail.com','+8801707245726','Bangladesh','Business Development Executive',1,'Negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/b-m-jayad-bin-ashik-7a78b5344?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android',NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1779670691105-pwl32h.pdf','Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to apply for the Sales & Growth Executive position at Dynime. With hands-on experience in lead generation, international client outreach, and remote business development, I am confident I can contribute meaningfully to your team from day one.\n\nIn my current role at Nexovation NXR Foundation, I manage the full sales cycle — from cold prospecting and proposal writing to client follow-up and deal closure — entirely in a remote setup. I work with international contacts daily, which has sharpened both my communication skills and my ability to build lasting client relationships across different markets.\n\nWhat draws me to Dynime is the focus on global projects and performance-based growth. I thrive in environments where results matter and where there is room to develop alongside the business.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Dynime\'s expansion goals.\n\nBest regards,\nB.M. Jayad Bin Ashik\n+88 01707245726\nbmjayad224@gmail.com','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; 24116RACCG Build/BP2A.250605.031.A3) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/14