23)','[\"Applicant\'s stated experience (1 year) is less than the job requirement of 3+ years.\",\"Calculated experience from resume (May 2026 - Present) suggests less than 1 year of professional experience, which conflicts with the application form and job requirement.\",\"The applicant is currently pursuing a BSc, which may reflect less practical experience than implied by the job title.\"]','Despite being underqualified in terms of stated years of experience (1 year vs 3+ required) and current calculated experience (less than a year), the applicant demonstrates strong relevant skills in remote international B2B sales, lead generation, client relationship management, and cultural awareness through their current role. Their enthusiasm for a performance-based global role aligns well with Dynime\'s culture. Further evaluation is recommended to assess their practical experience and cultur','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"bmjayad224@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801707245726\", \"+88 01707245726\", \"5.00 2022\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/b-m-jayad-bin-ashik-7a78b5344?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\", \"linkedin.com/in/jayad-bin-ashik\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"Currently pursuing a BSc in Industrial & Production Engineering.\",\"Has experience in lead generation, international client outreach, and remote business development.\",\"Manages the full sales cycle from cold prospecting to deal closure in a remote setup.\",\"Works with international contacts daily, enhancing communication and client relationship-building skills.\",\"Demonstrates strong alignment with Dynime\'s focus on global projects and performance-based growth.\",\"Proficient in lead generation, outbound outreach, client conversion, and pipeline management.\",\"Possesses strong written and spoken English for international client interactions.\",\"Experienced in remote collaboration and self-managed workflows.\",\"Skilled in Excel (Advanced), Power BI (Basic), MS Word, PowerPoint, Google Meet, Zoom, and email platforms.\"]'),('5cf7def8-0730-4136-a3a8-fe663b59df57','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Muhammad Ahsan','m.ahsanansari2003@gmail.com','+923111874939','Pakistan','Software Developer',3,'$10k','https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-ahsan-58389333b','https://github.com/ahsanansari1','public/full-stack-developer/1779290099014-lsz0dx.pdf','Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI’m excited to apply for the Full Stack Developer position. I’m currently working as a Software Developer at Ability Pvt Ltd, where I’ve contributed to building scalable web applications using React, Next.js, Node.js, TypeScript, and PostgreSQL.\n\nI enjoy building clean, production-ready features across the stack and collaborating closely with design and product teams. I also have experience working with APIs, database design, and modern development workflows including Git and deployment pipelines.\n\nI’d love the opportunity to contribute to your team and help build impactful products used by thousands of users.\n\nBest regards,\nMuhammad Ahsan','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 18_7 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Mobile/15E148 [LinkedInApp]/9.32.649','2026-05-20 15:15:03','2026-05-22 09:01:06',81,'high','[\"typescript\",\"react\",\"node\",\"postgres\",\"cloud\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"features\"]','[\"full-stack\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"mindset\",\"code\"]','Matched 10/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. Muhammad Ahsan is a strong candidate for the Full Stack Developer position, demonstrating significant alignment with the technical requirements and a clear product mindset. His experience with React, Node.js, TypeScript, CI/CD, and cloud deployments makes him a good fit. The typo in the employment dates should be clarified, and specific experience with PostgreSQL/Supabase merits further discussion.','2026-05-20 15:15:17',3660,'[\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"Next.js\",\"React.js\",\"MongoDB\",\"SQL\",\"Docker\",\"AWS EC2\",\"AWS S3\",\"CI/CD\",\"GitHub\",\"GitLab\",\"Nginx\",\"Reverse Proxy\",\"SSL\",\"Jest\",\"RabbitMQ\",\"RPC communication\",\"Git\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"ShadCN\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Socket.io\",\"Cloudflare\",\"Cloudinary\"]','[\"Software Developer\",\"Full Stack MERN Developer\",\"MERN Stack Development Intern\"]',3.000000,'Mehran University of Engineering & Technology, Jamshoro, PAK - Bachelor of Science (BS) in Computer Science (Nov 2021- Dec 2025)','[\"While general SQL is mentioned, direct experience with PostgreSQL or Supabase needs more explicit confirmation on the resume.\",\"The resume states \'Feb 2026 – Present\' for current professional experience, which appears to be a typo and should be clarified.\"]','Muhammad Ahsan is a strong candidate for the Full Stack Developer position, demonstrating significant alignment with the technical requirements and a clear product mindset. His experience with React, Node.js, TypeScript, CI/CD, and cloud deployments makes him a good fit. The typo in the employment dates should be clarified, and specific experience with PostgreSQL/Supabase merits further discussion.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"m.ahsanansari2003@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"https://github.com/ahsanansari1\"], \"phones\": [\"+923111874939\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-ahsan-58389333b\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://muethub.live\", \"https://shortiffy.vercel.app\", \"https://github.com/ahsanansari1\"]}','[\"3 years of full-stack experience aligning with the job\'s 3+ years requirement.\",\"Proficiency in React, Node.js, and TypeScript, directly matching key requirements.\",\"Experience with PostgreSQL mentioned in the cover letter and implied by SQL skills, though Supabase is not explicitly listed.\",\"Comfort with CI/CD pipelines, Docker, AWS deployments, Nginx, and SSL certificates demonstrates cloud and CI/CD comfort.\",\"Strong product mindset evidenced by developing end-to-end features and collaborating with design/product teams.\",\"Experience in building scalable web applications and microservices architecture.\",\"Proven ability to ship production-ready code across the stack.\"]'),('5d4552dc-6800-43c5-ae90-0faf7117d195','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Umar Dawood','umardawood26@gmail.com','+92 333 0432962','Pakistan','Frontend Developer',1,'Negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/umar-dawood-84811913a/','https://umar-resume-app.netlify.app/','public/frontend-developer/1779708417480-of99r7.pdf','With over 9 years of experience as a Frontend Developer, i have built a strong foundation in creating responsive, user-friendly web interfaces using HTML, CSS, and Tailwind CSS. \n\nThroughout my career, i have worked with design tools such as Figma and Adobe XD, transforming complex UI designs into high-quality, production-ready web experiences with a focus on performance, accessibility, and cross-browser compatibility.\n\nIn addition to my core frontend expertise, i have been actively expanding my skills in modern JavaScript and React.js. I have hands-on experience working with React fundamentals including functional components, props, state management, and hooks.\n\nI am continuously learning and building projects to strengthen my understanding of component based architecture and modern frontend development practices.','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-25 11:27:01','2026-05-25 11:27:13',55,'medium','[\"react\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"understanding\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"typescript\",\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 8/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 1y. The candidate presents a strong background in foundational frontend technologies, design systems, and has exposure to React.js and TypeScript. The discrepancy in reported experience years needs clarification. If the 9 years of experience truly reflects the depth of the technologies listed in the job description, particularly React and TypeScript, the candidate could be a good fit. More information is needed to assess their proficiency in React/TypeScript beyond the foundational level mentioned.','2026-05-25 11:27:13',3468,'[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"JavaScript\",\"React.js\",\"Figma\",\"Adobe XD\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Sass\",\"ES6+\",\"DOM Manipulation\",\"API Integration\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"VS Code\",\"Chrome DevTools\",\"Responsive Design\",\"Flexbox\",\"CSS Grid\",\"Mobile-First Development\",\"Cross-Browser Compatibility\",\"Next.js\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"Frontend / UI Developer\",\"Frontend HTML CSS Developer\",\"Web User Interface Developer\"]',9.000000,'BS (Hons) – University of the Punjab (2008 - 2012)','[\"Declared 1 year of experience in the application form while resume states 9+ years, which is a discrepancy.\",\"Resume indicates a focus on learning and building projects in React.js rather than extensive professional experience despite 9 years experience, which seems to imply a more junior React skillset than 9 years of overall experience would typically suggest.\"]','The candidate presents a strong background in foundational frontend technologies, design systems, and has exposure to React.js and TypeScript. The discrepancy in reported experience years needs clarification. If the 9 years of experience truly reflects the depth of the technologies listed in the job description, particularly React and TypeScript, the candidate could be a good fit. More information is needed to assess their proficiency in React/TypeScript beyond the foundational level mentioned.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"umardawood26@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+92 333 0432962\", \"+923330432962\", \"+92 3330432962\", \"2008 - 2012\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/umar-dawood-84811913a/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://umar-resume-app.netlify.app/\", \"https://remotebase.com/\", \"https://interview.talently.ai/\", \"https://ai4hr.talently.ai/\", \"https://hirefest.remotebase.com/\"]}','[\"Over 9 years of experience as a Frontend Developer.\",\"Strong foundation in HTML, CSS, and Tailwind CSS.\",\"Experience with design tools such as Figma and Adobe XD.\",\"Hands-on experience with React fundamentals including functional components, props, state management, and hooks.\",\"Actively expanding skills in modern JavaScript and React.js.\"]'),('5dcf427e-eaef-4afc-923b-9fc5c8ea675b','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Muhammad kamran','contactwithmr.kamran@gmail.com','+923263170508','Pakistan','Frontend Engineer @Tibb Labs',3,'70k','https://www.linkedin.com/in/mkamrandev','https://mkamrandev.vercel.app/','public/frontend-developer/1779211519174-lhzbkv.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Frontend Developer position. I possess strong expertise in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, TypeScript, and Next.js. My professional journey includes two years of hands-on experience at Tibb Labs and iCreativez Technologies, where I successfully delivered between 8 to 10 projects.\n\nMy technical experience extends to building pixel-perfect frontend solutions and seamlessly integrating APIs developed with Express, Node.js, and MongoDB. Some of my key project highlights include:\n\nTibb Ecosystem: Developed Tibb Scribe (tibbscribe.com), Tibb Forms, and the Tibb App.\n\nHealthcare Solutions: Built a comprehensive Doctor Clinic Management System.\n\nAI-Driven Solutions: Developed an Email Parser and a Meeting Helper.\n\nDiverse Applications: Successfully delivered a Barter Application and a Quiz Application.\n\nI pride myself on collaborating effectively within cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality products. I am dedicated to writing clean, efficient code and am eager to bring my problem-solving abilities to your ongoing initiatives.\n\nI have attached my resume for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can benefit your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nMuhammad Kamran','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-19 17:25:22','2026-05-21 16:58:42',31,'low','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"detail\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"understanding\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 9/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate\'s technical skills and project experience align well with the Frontend Developer role, particularly in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. The portfolio and specific project mentions demonstrate practical application. The discrepancy in the Tibb Labs dates needs clarification. Recommendation for interview.','2026-05-19 17:25:32',2797,'[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"API integration\",\"Express.js\",\"Node.js\",\"MongoDB\",\"MERN stack\",\"RESTful APIs\",\"Responsive Design\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"Agile\",\"Mongoose\",\"Vercel\",\"Netlify\",\"Railway\",\"Python\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"Frontend Engineer\",\"MERN Stack Developer\",\"Software Engineer\"]',3.000000,'Bachelor of Science (Computer Science) | QUEST University| 2025','[\"No explicit mention of \'Web Vitals\' or \'a11y\' in the submission, only implied relevance.\",\"The dates for \'Tibb Labs\' (March – May 2025) suggest future employment or a typo, which conflicts with currently stated experience.\"]','The candidate\'s technical skills and project experience align well with the Frontend Developer role, particularly in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. The portfolio and specific project mentions demonstrate practical application. The discrepancy in the Tibb Labs dates needs clarification. Recommendation for interview.','{\"other\": [\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=abcd1234&hl=en\", \"https://journal.50sea.com/index.php/IJIST/article/view/1288\"], \"emails\": [\"contactwithmr.kamran@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923263170508\", \"+923 263 170508\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mkamrandev\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://mkamrandev.vercel.app/\", \"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=abcd1234&hl=en\", \"https://journal.50sea.com/index.php/IJIST/article/view/1288\"]}','[\"3 years of experience mentioned in professional summary matches requirements.\",\"Strong expertise in React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS noted in both cover letter and professional experience.\",\"Experience with design systems implied by \\\"pixel-perfect frontend solutions\\\" and focus on clean UI/UX.\",\"Developed and delivered between 8 to 10 projects, including tibbscribe.com, Tibb Forms, and the Tibb App.\",\"Proven ability to integrate APIs and work with backend technologies (Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB).\",\"Mentions \\\"clean UI/UX, performance optimization, and mobile responsiveness\\\" aligning with Web Vitals concepts.\"]'),('5e46e061-0bcf-4509-b42b-399290cd97f4','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Danyal khan','mdanyalkhan2000@gmail.com','+923169367630','Pakistan','Frontend Engineer',3,'$500 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/danyalkhan20','https://danyalportfolio.vercel.app',NULL,NULL,'career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-23 23:12:32','2026-05-23 23:12:48',33,'low','[\"frontend\"]','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"understanding\",\"web\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','Matched 1/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate matches the experience requirements and current role. However, without a resume, critical skill detection for React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, design systems, Web Vitals, and a11y cannot be confirmed. The expected salary is significantly lower than typical for a Frontend Developer with 3 years of experience in many markets, which could be a red flag depending on the company\'s compensation strategy and location. No resume uploaded.','2026-05-23 23:12:48',0,'[]','[\"Frontend Engineer\"]',3.000000,'','[]','The candidate matches the experience requirements and current role. However, without a resume, critical skill detection for React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, design systems, Web Vitals, and a11y cannot be confirmed. The expected salary is significantly lower than typical for a Frontend Developer with 3 years of experience in many markets, which could be a red flag depending on the company\'s compensation strategy and location.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"mdanyalkhan2000@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923169367630\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/danyalkhan20\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://danyalportfolio.vercel.app\"]}','[]'),('5f94aeb1-7089-4d49-a3f6-47d4fec2785b','ec820daa-0e32-4508-83c8-fdfe04df6881','sales-closer-bde','Business Development Executive','Rubayet Ahmed','reanahmed6@gmail.com','+880 1635476058','Bangladesh','Admission Officer',3,'$120 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/rubayet-ahmed-682b28192/?locale=en',NULL,'public/sales-closer-bde/1779783338449-h66xjx.pdf','26 May, 2026	\nBusiness Development Executive	\nDynamite.\n\nSubject: Application for Business Development Executive.\n\nDear Sir,\nIn response to your job advertisement published in your official website, I would like to introduce myself to you as I believe I have the skills, qualifications, and experience necessary to make a significant contribution to your organization.\nI have completed my B.Sc. in Computer Science & Engineering from the Department of Computer Science & Engineering at Eastern University. My strong interest in the field of Computer Science has helped me develop a solid foundation in programming languages and technical concepts.\nIn addition to my academic background, I have gained valuable experience in Sales & Marketing, Admissions, Student Counseling, Documentation Handling & Application Handling. Through these roles, I have developed strong communication, client relationship, and marketing skills, which allow me to effectively guide and support students while achieving organizational goals.\nI believe working in a reputed organization like your one will provide me an excellent \nopportunity for my career. I would truly be grateful if I finally selected for that post and I will \nprove myself to be an important asset for your company through my dedication, sincerity and \nhighest level of professionalism.\n\nSincerely,\nMd. Rubayet Ahmed \nCell no: +8801635476058\nE-mail: reanahmed6@gmail.com','career-page','reviewing',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-26 08:15:39','2026-05-28 12:54:56',48,'medium','[\"selling\",\"english\",\"communication\",\"development\",\"executive\",\"sales\",\"digital\",\"international\",\"support\"]','[\"b2b\",\"closing\",\"consultative\",\"track\",\"record\",\"exceeding\",\"quota\",\"manager\",\"dynime\",\"growth\",\"relationships\",\"close\",\"deals\",\"saas\",\"services\"]','Matched 9/24 keywords for \"Business Development Executive\". Required ~2y, candidate has 3y. The candidate demonstrates strong lead generation and client communication skills, which are relevant to some aspects of the role. 