llector Incharge @Autism society habilitation organizations',1,'Negotiable',NULL,NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1779663761944-v54xf4.pdf','I\'ve experience with sales and marketing.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; A059 Build/BQ2A.250721.001-BP2A.250605.031.A3; wv) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/148.0.7778.120 Mobile Safari/537.36[FBAN/EMA;FBLC/en_US;FBAV/512.0.0.7.104;FBCX/modulariab;]','2026-05-24 23:02:43','2026-05-28 14:25:59',24,'low','[\"sales\",\"executive\",\"want\"]','[\"international\",\"b2b\",\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"self-driven\",\"remote-ready\",\"development\",\"hiring\",\"growth\",\"remote\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"career\",\"dynime\",\"relationships\",\"drive\",\"careers\"]','Matched 3/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 1y. Reject','2026-05-24 23:02:52',1785,'[\"Negotiation\",\"Problem Solving\",\"Customer Service\",\"Communication\",\"Adaptability\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"MSWord\",\"MSExcel\"]','[\"Sales Executive\",\"Sales Representative\",\"POS Associate\",\"Data collector Incharge\"]',3.000000,'B.B.A.(Hon’s) Management from Dania University College (2020-2025); Higher Secondary Certificate (H.S.C.) Business Studies from Dhaka City College (2018-2019); Secondary School Certificate (S.S.C.) Business Studies from Bandura Holy Cross School and College (2017-2018)','[\"The job requires 3+ years of international B2B sales experience. The applicant has 3 years of sales experience, primarily in B2C domestic markets.\",\"The applicant\'s stated current position as \\\"Data collector Incharge\\\" does not directly align with sales, and their sales experience appears to have ended in December 2023.\",\"The requested salary of $150-$300/month is very low for an international sales executive position, which might indicate a mismatch in expectations or understanding of the role\'s scope (or could be