proving team operational efficiency, I believe I can make an immediate and meaningful contribution to your Customer Success function.\n\nIn my most recent role as a Junior Technical Research Analyst at ALXICORN, I worked closely with cross-functional stakeholders to coordinate deliverables, synthesize complex data from 15+ platforms into actionable reports, and maintain structured documentation across the team. I built SOPs from scratch, streamlined onboarding processes that reduced new-hire ramp time by 15%, and consistently ensured that internal workflows stayed organized and on schedule — exactly the kind of coordination, follow-up, and accountability your role calls for.\n\nPrior to that, at Business Globalizer, I was directly responsible for aggregating market intelligence from 10+ sources into a centralized database, improving data accessibility by 20% across the team. I also provided technical support to fintech end users, which elevated customer satisfaction scores by 30%. These experiences sharpened my written communication, issue resolution, and organizational skills — all of which are central to managing client accounts effectively.\n\nI am comfortable working with CRM tools and productivity platforms (JIRA, ClickUp, Zapier), which gives me a practical head start in maintaining account notes, tracking client requests, and preparing accurate reports and summaries. I also bring strong written communication skills developed through creating PRDs, user journey documentation, and cross-functional process guides — so client-facing written updates and summaries would come naturally.\n\nWhat draws me to Dynime specifically is your focus on building digital products that genuinely serve people. As someone who has spent the past year translating user pain points into structured product requirements, I appreciate organizations that put the client experience at the center of everything — and I am excited to be on the frontline of delivering that experience directly.\n\nI am confident that my background in coordination, documentation, stakeholder communication, and CRM-adjacent tooling makes me a strong fit for this position. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nMd. Yeamin Islam\n\nyeamin.cse@gmail.com  ·  +880 1850-265506','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/148.0.0.0','2026-05-26 16:32:13','2026-05-28 12:56:01',33,'low','[\"client-facing\",\"organization\",\"written\",\"communication\",\"comfortable\",\"crm\",\"success\",\"account\",\"coordinator\"]','[\"follow-through\",\"spreadsheets\"]','Matched 9/11 keywords for \"Client Success / Account Coordinator\". Required ~1y, candidate has 1y. The candidate appears to be a strong fit for the Client Success / Account Coordinator role due to direct experience in client-facing coordination and communication, demonstrated organizational skills, and proficiency with relevant tools. The discrepancies in employment dates on the resume should be clarified.','2026-05-28 12:56:01',4080,'[\"Fintech Market Research\",\"Competitive Intelligence\",\"Competitive Analysis\",\"AI\",\"Data-Driven Decision Making\",\"KPI Tracking\",\"Stakeholder Management\",\"Agile\",\"Scrum\",\"SDLC\",\"STLC\",\"DeFi & Blockchain Analysis\",\"B2C / B2B Product Strategy\",\"User Journey Mapping\",\"SOP Documentation\",\"Process Optimization\",\"Regression Testing\",\"Defect Management\",\"JIRA\",\"ClickUp\",\"SQL\",\"Google Analytics\",\"Zapier\",\"Prompt Engineering\",\"Market Research\",\"Data Analysis\",\"Figma\",\"Canva\",\"Process Flow Diagrams\",\"Blockchain\",\"DeFi\",\"CEX Platforms\",\"Cryptocurrency\",\"B2C Product Analysis\",\"Client Tacing\",\"CRM\",\"Spreadsheets\",\"Written Communication\"]','[\"Junior Technical Research Analyst\",\"Junior Technical Researcher\",\"Programming Analyst Intern\"]',1.000000,'BSc. in Computer Science and Engineering','[\"The listed \'Junior Technical Research Analyst\' start date (January 2025) and end date (March 2026) in the resume conflict with typical employment periods relative to the current date.\",\"The listed \'Junior Technical Researcher\' start date (September 2024) and end date (December 2024) also suggest future employment or a typo in the resume data.\"]','The candidate appears to be a strong fit for the Client Success / Account Coordinator role due to direct experience in client-facing coordination and communication, demonstrated organizational skills, and proficiency with relevant tools. The discrepancies in employment dates on the resume should be clarified.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"yeamin.cse@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801850265506\", \"+880 1850-265506\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mdyeaminislam/\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"1+ year of client-facing research and coordination experience is directly relevant to the client-facing requirement.\",\"Proven experience with CRM workflows and comfort with CRM tools (JIRA, ClickUp, Zapier mentioned) aligns with the job requirement.\",\"Strong organizational skills demonstrated through building SOPs, streamlining onboarding processes, and maintaining structured documentation.\",\"Excellent written communication skills are evident from creating PRDs, user journey documentation, and cross-functional process guides, which is a core job requirement.\",\"Experience in technical support and improving customer satisfaction scores (30% increase) indicates a client-centric mindset.\",\"Aggregated market intelligence into centralized databases, improving data accessibility and demonstrating strong data organization.\"]'),('6b59506a-ebae-4f6c-8ccc-57797e4c8e87','f80a30f6-ed2f-43ca-92b7-8c06f6edf0a3','content-seo-specialist','Content & SEO Specialist','Rafayatul Kabir Rafah','rkrabby97@gmail.com','+8801675672519','Bangladesh','Marketing Virtual Assistant',5,'$800 USD / monthl