nt with Ahrefs, SEMrush, Google Search Console for tracking rankings and traffic, as requested.\",\"Knowledgeable in schema and Core Web Vitals, a direct requirement.\",\"Strong English writing and editing skills demonstrated in cover letter and implied by content creation experience.\",\"Experience in both SEO/SEM and content marketing, along with a broad range of related digital marketing skills.\",\"Certified in Google Analytics and mentions using GA-4.\"]'),('6d439724-2164-4100-aa12-e48858346244','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Hamza Ali','hamza.ali8@outlook.com','+92 3056810969','Pakistan','Software Engineer @ Zenkoders',2,'Pkr 130000','https://www.linkedin.com/in/hamza-ali-9387a022b','https://portfolio-iota-navy-89.vercel.app/','public/full-stack-developer/1779291135994-sozhdn.pdf','I am excited to apply for the Full Stack Engineer position. I have hands-on experience building modern, scalable web applications using NestJS, Node.js, TypeScript, and React.js, with a strong focus on backend architecture and API development. \n\n In my current role as a Full-Stack Software Engineer at Zenkoders, I design and build robust, production-grade backend systems using NestJS and TypeScript. My backend experience includes architecting RESTful APIs and real-time services with WebSockets, implementing server-side logic for advanced filtering, sorting, and pagination at scale, and structuring modular, maintainable codebases following NestJS best practices such as dependency injection, guards, interceptors, and custom decorators. I also have experience optimizing API performance and data flow, which directly supports the front-end applications I build using React.js and Next.js. \n\n I enjoy working closely with frontend developers and designers to ensure seamless integration between the client and server, and I take pride in writing clean, reusable, and well-documented code that teams can build on confidently.','career-pa