g development processes, documenting systems, and ensuring timely delivery under pressure. I’ve also handled hiring coordination, mentoring junior developers, infrastructure planning, and operational decision-making for multiple products.\n\nAlongside technical expertise, I’m comfortable using modern collaboration and project management tools and adapting quickly to new systems and workflows. My combination of technical background, leadership experience, process-oriented mindset, and communication skills helps me bridge the gap between operations and execution effectively.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-21 02:42:46','2026-05-21 16:58:21',34,'low','[\"operations\",\"project\",\"management\",\"agile\",\"scrum\",\"communication\",\"comfortable\",\"tools\",\"clickup\",\"manager\",\"leadership\"]','[\"pmp\",\"knowledge\",\"organization\",\"notion\",\"linear\"]','Matched 11/16 keywords for \"Operations & Project Manager\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate is an exceptionally strong fit for the Operations & Project Manager role. Tariqul demonstrates extensive experience in project management (6+ years, exceeding the 3-year requirement), a strong technical background beneficial for operations, and direct experience with relevant tools like ClickUp. Their proven track record of improving workflows, leading teams, and coordinating cross-functional operations aligns perfectly with the job description.','2026-05-21 02:42:57',6093,'[\"Laravel\",\"React\",\"API systems\",\"CI/CD workflows\",\"Multi-tenant architectures\",\"Project planning\",\"Sprint management\",\"Resource coordination\",\"Stakeholder communication\",\"Scope management\",\"QA collaboration\",\"Delivery execution\",\"Product development\",\"Roadmap ownership\",\"SaaS funnel design\",\"MVP scoping\",\"A/B testing\",\"Growth loops\",\"Activation & Retention\",\"Monetisation strateg