ed experience (2 years) is slightly below the \'3+ years\' requirement, though the cover letter addresses this.\"]','Despite the slight discrepancy in formal years of experience and the future start date for his current role, Hamza Sarwar presents as a very strong candidate. His detailed project experience and technical skills align closely with the job requirements, especially in React, Node, Typescript, Postgres/Supabase, CI/CD, and a clear product mindset. The cover letter proactively addresses the experience gap and highlights practical, hands-on learning. Further clarification on the \'December 2025\' start','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"Engr.hamzarao@gmail.com\", \"engr.hamzarao@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"GitHub\"], \"phones\": [\"+923032912247\", \"+92 303 2912247\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hamzasarwar-full-stack-developer?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\", \"LinkedIn\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"Proficient in React.js, Next.js, Node.js, and TypeScript, aligning with core job requirements.\",\"Experience with Postgres/Supabase mentioned via integration of Supabase in a junior role.\",\"Strong background in CI/CD and cloud deployment across AWS Amplify, Railway, and Vercel.\",\"Demonstrates a product mindset through successful delivery of end-to-end features and owning architecture/deployment.\",\"Led end-to-end development of multiple production platforms and owned architecture, implementation, and deployment.\",\"Integrated multiple LLM APIs and built AI-powered features for enhanced functionality.\",\"Owned full security hardening and cloud deployment across projects.\",\"Contributed to agile sprints, feature planning, code reviews, debugging, and post-release iteration.\",\"Built a full-stack e-commerce platform with web and mobile components, integrating payment processing and AI recommendations.\",\"Architected serverless backends and hardened platforms with security features.\"]'),('7a6c304a-f4