mputer Science, FAST NUCES','[]','The candidate is a strong fit for the Full Stack Developer role. They have extensive experience in React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL, fulfilling the core technical requirements. Their experience with GraphQL, AWS, microservices, CI/CD, and a history of developing end-to-end features demonstrates a strong product mindset.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"faizanfarooq993@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+923096296233\", \"+92 309 6296233\", \"2021 - 09\", \"2024 - 12\", \"2018 - 06\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/faizi111/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://faizan-farooq.vercel.app/\"]}','[\"Developed new features across the stack using React + Node/Postgres and other technologies.\",\"Experience with GraphQL Federation services and microservices architecture.\",\"Optimized database performance including PostgreSQL and TimescaleDB.\",\"Integrated various third-party APIs like Meta Graph API, Stripe, Shopify, OpenAI.\",\"Conducted code reviews and mentored junior developers.\",\"Experience with CI/CD through GitHub Actions and cloud platforms like AWS.\",\"Worked on end-to-end features and has a strong product mindset shown by building various applications and platforms.\"]'),('7a9dc98d-69c7-4b2e-8b59-82876ab58d8e','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Falak Khan','falakejazkhan18@gmail.com','+923259459676','Pakistan','Frontend + Devops engineer',2,'80k','https:/www.linkedin.com/in/falak-khan-22a2352a0',NULL,'public/frontend-developer/1779269824741-5tezh7.pdf','I am writing to express my interest in the Frontend Developer position at your company. I have hands-on experience building modern, responsive web applications using React.js, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS, along with a strong understanding of JavaScript, HTML, and CSS.\n\nI enjoy turning UI/UX designs into clean, functional, and user-friendly interfaces. During my recent projects, I have worked on features like dynami