 using Docker\nand CI/CD pipelines, ensuring scalability, reliability, and efficient production\ndelivery. My work often focuses on performance optimisation, caching strategies\n(Redis), and designing modular, maintainable system architectures. I am confident\nin my ability to contribute to both frontend and backend development while also\nbringing value in AI-driven features and cloud-based deployments. I am highly\nmotivated to work in collaborative environments where I can solve complex\nengineering problems and build impactful products.\nThank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to\nfurther discuss how my skills and experience align with your team’s goals.\nSincerely,\nDanish Ali','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 17:10:22','2026-05-21 16:58:24',30,'low','[\"full-stack\",\"typescript\",\"react\",\"node\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"cloud\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"features\"]','[\"comfort\",\"mindset\",\"technical\",\"code\"]','Matched 11/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate is a strong fit for the Full Stack Developer role. They meet or exceed all stated technical requirements and demonstrate relevant experience in collaboration and product development. Their additional experience in AI/LLM systems is a bonus.','2026-05-20 17:10:35',5754,'[\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Node\",\"Postgres\",\"Supabase\",\"CI/CD\",\"cloud\",\"Python\",\"MERN stack\",\"Express.js\",\"SQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"REST API\",\"JWT\",\"OAuth2\",\"RBAC\",\"AI\",\"LLM\",\"RAG systems\",\"Mistral\",\"Hugging Face\",\"semantic search\",\"vector databases\",\"Qdrant\",\"WebSockets\",\"SSE\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Redis\",\"Next.js\",\"FastAPI\",\"LangChain\",\"Embeddings\",\"Prompt Engineering\",\"Context Management\",\"Azure Event Hubs\",\"Stripe API\",\"Cloudinary\",\"Twitter OAuth\",\"Fire