ce. Their recent graduation date indicates less professional experience than desired. Despite this, their project work with AI and Kafka, along with performance optimization achievements, indicate strong technical capabilities. May be a good fit for a more junior role or if the','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"saadakmal460@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/saadakmal460\"], \"phones\": [\"03304133887\", \"03304133887 380\"], \"linkedin\": [\"linkedin.com/in/saad-akmal\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"1+ year of experience in Node.js and relevant backend technologies.\",\"Experience with Reactjs and Nextjs for frontend development.\",\"Proficient in PostgreSQL.\",\"Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS) and Docker.\",\"Experience in developing multi-tenant platforms and integrating APIs.\",\"Optimized API response times and improved system performance in previous roles.\",\"Experience with real-time data pipelines (Kafka) and AI-powered applications (RAG).\"]'),('90bb22b9-aca0-4cad-b4cd-8e1c355c37bf','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Haider Ali','haiderali.webdev2003@gmail.com','+923230950901','Pakistan','Associate Frontend Developer',2,'110000 to 120000 pkr/month but nogtiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/haider-ali-0a46462bb','https://www.luminatalents.com/ https://ownersinventory.com/ https://app.kolabme.com/','public/frontend-developer/1779261944760-x8v491.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Frontend Developer role at your\norganization. With two + years of professional experience as a Frontend Developer, I have built and shipped responsive, high-performance web\napplications across ERP systems, healthcare platforms, recruitment tools, and\nstreaming services. My expertise in React.js, Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, and\nGSAP animations, combined with a passion for clean, scalable code and pixel- perfect UI implementation, makes me an ideal candidate to contribute immediately to\nyour engineering team.\nIn my current role as Associate Frontend Developer at Red Star Technologies, I\nlead frontend development for multiple client projects using Next.js and Redux Toolkit, collaborate directly with backend engineers on REST API integration, and deliver\nanimated, high-fidelity components with GSAP. Prior to this, at Alright Tech, I built\nReact.js interfaces with Redux Toolkit and established shared component patterns\nusing Tailwind CSS and MUI, reducing styling inconsistencies across the team. My portfolio demonstrates end-to-end frontend ownership and full-stack capability. For Owners\' Inventory, an ERP and inventory management system, I built the\ncomplete frontend with Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS, designed RESTful\nAPIs with Node.js and Express.js, integrated MongoDB for real-time data\nmanagement, and introduced GSAP-powered micro-interactions that improved\nperceived responsiveness on data-heavy screens. For KolabMe, a healthcare\nappointment platform, I delivered a 30+ reusable component library in React.js and\nTypeScript, reducing UI development time by approximately 40%, while prioritizing\naccessibility for non-technical healthcare users. I also architected the Lumina Talent\nAdvisory recruitment dashboard in Next.js, integrated real-time data APIs for live\napplication status updates, and built YouStream, a video streaming platform with\nRedux-managed authentication and dark/light theme switching. Additionally, I\ncontributed to the Red Star Technologies corporate website using Laravel Blade\nand SCSS, achieving SEO-friendly, responsive layouts with GSAP scroll animations\nto increase engagement on conversion pages. Beyond technical execution, I thrive in collaborative, agile teams and am passionate\nabout performance optimisation, accessibility, and maintainable code. I actively use\nmodern AI tooling (ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor, DeepSeek) to accelerate development\nwithout sacrificing quality, and I am equally comfortable working in Linux\nenvironments, Git, and Postman.\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience with scalable\nfrontend architectures, animated user interfaces, and full-stack integration can help\nyour team deliver exceptional web experiences. Thank you for your time and\nconsideration. \nSincerely, \nHaider Ali\nFrontend Developer\n\nNote: Please note that my work links have also been added to my resume for your reference.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 07:25:46','2026-05-22 09:01:24',74,'high','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"web\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"understanding\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 8/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. Haider Ali is a strong candidate for the Frontend Developer role. Although slightly under the stated experience for 3+ years, his extensive project work, explicit skill match with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and demonstrated attention to detail and accessibility make him a very competitive applicant. His ability to build and ship high-performance web applications across diverse platforms is a significant asset.','2026-05-20 07:25:58',5174,'[\"React.js\",\"Next.js\",\"TypeScript\",\"GSAP\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Redux Toolkit\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"MongoDB\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"SCSS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MUI\",\"Context API\",\"JavaScript\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"Postman\",\"REST APIs\",\"Linux\",\"Laravel Blade\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"Associate Frontend Developer\",\"Junior Frontend Developer\"]',2.000000,'Bachelor of Computer Science, Federal Urdu University of Arts, Science and Technology, Islamabad (2021-2025)','[\"Experience is 2 years, slightly below the \'3+ years React + TypeScript\' requirement, though this is partially mitigated by e