ume showcases direct experience in leading features end-to-end and delivering measurable impact.','2026-05-19 18:38:57',5021,'[\"React\",\"Next.js\",\"React Hooks\",\"Redux\",\"JavaScript\",\"Typescript\",\"Material UI\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Storybook\",\"OpenAI API\",\"Google ADK\",\"CrewAI\",\"Ollama\",\"LangGraph\",\"Pinecone\",\"PgVector\",\"Gradio\",\"Guardrails\",\"RAG\",\"Prompt Engineering\",\"Semantic Search\",\"Django\",\"FastAPI\",\"Node.js\",\"GraphQL\",\"Supabase\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"SQL\",\"Redis\",\"AWS ElastiCache\",\"DynamoDB\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"Webpack\",\"Sentry\",\"Docker\",\"Vite\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS\",\"MongoDB\",\"Jira\",\"Clickup\",\"Puppeteer\",\"Moyasar\",\"Mixpanel\"]','[\"Software Engineer\",\"Senior Software Engineer\",\"Associate Software Engineer\",\"Junior Software Engineer\",\"Full-Stack Developer\",\"Program Manager\"]',8.000000,'M.S. in Data Engineering and Information Management, N.E.D University, Karachi, Pakistan (11/2020 - 03/2023); B.S. in Computer Science, University of Karachi, Karachi, Pakistan (01/2016 - 12/2019)','[]','The candidate is an excellent fit, possessing extensive full-stack experience (8 years, exceeding the 3+ year requirement) with the exact technologies listed (React, Node, Postgres/Supabase), comfort with CI/CD and cloud, and a strong product mindset. Their resume showcases direct experience in leading features end-to-end and delivering measurable impact.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"aahadaazar@hotmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/aahadaazar\"], \"phones\": [\"+923472443125\", \"2023 - 10\", \"2022 - 06\", \"2020 - 06\", \"2018 - 12\", \"2020 - 03\", \"2016 - 12\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/aahad-aazar-b83b77197/\", \"linkedin.com/in/aahad-aazar-b83b77197\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://aahadaazar.com\"]}','[\"8 years of product engineering experience, consistently building and scaling web applications.\",\"Strong full-stack experience with React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL/Supabase, directly aligning with the job requirements.\",\"Experience with CI/CD tools (Git, GitHub, Docker) and cloud platforms (AWS ElastiCache, DynamoDB).\",\"Demonstrated \\\"product mindset\\\" through owning end-to-end features, collaborating with PMs, and driving measurable impact (e.g., improved response times, reduced costs).\",\"Experienced in developing new features across the stack and participating in code reviews and technical decisions.\",\"History of promotions and leading initiatives, indicating strong technical and leadership capabilities.\"]'),('a4c19b31-838f-4157-95f5-b1278a236c91','cda4fd97-de3d-4ef0-8353-b8da73e41972','performance-marketer','Performance Marketer','abir Imtiaj','abeerimtiaj@gmail.com','+8801624657444','Bangladesh','Digital Marketing Manager',6,'$550 USD / monthly','https://linkedin.com/in/abirimtiaj',NULL,'public/performance-marketer/1779639827441-nptv0v.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the Performance Marketer position. After reading the role description, one line stood out — \"Own paid media end-to-end.\" That is exactly how I have always worked.\nI do not manage campaigns from a distance. I write the briefs, set the bids, test the creatives, read the data, and optimize until the numbers move. Over 6+ years, this hands-on approach has delivered results that I am genuinely proud of —\nAt Sprihaware, I built and managed the complete paid media operation from scratch — Pixel setup, Conversion API integration, audience building, creative testing, and retargeting — delivering a 14x ROAS on a $300/month budget. Every taka spent came back fourteen times over.\nAt Solus Corporation, I owned paid acquisition across Meta and Google while simultaneously managing organic — scaling monthly revenue from BDT 5L to 30L in under 12 months. I tracked performance through GA4, GTM, and custom attribution — making budget and bidding decisions based on data, not intuition.\nWhat I bring to this role specifically —\n\nCreative briefing to campaign launch: I have directed full creative production — video, photography, ad copy — and translated that into campaigns built around conversion, not just clicks\nCAC & ROAS optimization: I have consistently reduced cost-per-acquisition through retargeting precision and creative iteration — bringing cost-per-sale below $1 at Sprihaware through server-side tracking\nBudget management: Managed monthly ad budgets across multiple campaigns simultaneously — always accountable to clear performance targets\nReporting: Delivered weekly performance reports to management with clear insight on what is working, what is not, and what changes I am making\n\nI am comfortable with Meta Ads Manager, Google Ads, GA4, and GTM at a hands-on level. I am also honest — I do not have SQL experience, but I am analytically strong and learn fast. My decisions have always been data-driven, even without advanced database querying.\nI would love the opportunity to bring this performance-first mindset to your team.\nBest regards,\nAbir Imtiaj\n+8801624657444\nabeerimtiaj@gmail.com','career-page','reviewing',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-24 16:23:47','2026-05-24 16:26:33',87,'high','[\"paid\",\"media\",\"hands-on\",\"ga4\",\"meta\",\"google\",\"ads\",\"analytics\",\"sql\",\"scaling\",\"performance\",\"marketer\",\"marketing\",\"growth\",\"creative\"]','[\"excel\",\"saas\",\"e-commerce\"]','Matched 15/18 keywords for \"Performance Marketer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 6y. The candidate is a strong fit for the Performance Marketer role due to extensive hands-on experience in paid media, proven track record with Meta and Google Ads, expertise in GA4, and clear achievements in optimizing CAC and ROAS. While direct SQL experience is missing, the candidate demonstrates strong analytical capabilities and a data-driven approach. The e-commerce/SaaS scaling experience aligns well with preferred qualifications.','2026-05-24 16:23:59',4265,'[\"paid media\",\"GA4\",\"Meta Ads\",\"Google Ads\",\"analytics\",\"Excel\",\"SQL\",\"SaaS\",\"e-commerce\",\"creative briefing\",\"bidding strategy\",\"reporting\",\"paid campaigns\",\"budget management\",\"creative testing\",\"CAC optimization\",\"ROAS optimization\",\"LTV\",\"landing page conversion\",\"paid media operation\",\"pixel setup\",\"Conversion API integration\",\"audience building\",\"retargeting\",\"paid acquisition\",\"organic marketing\",\"GTM\",\"custom attribution\",\"creative production\",\"video production\",\"photography\",\"ad copy\",\"cost-per-acquisition\",\"server-side tracking\",\"Growth Marketing\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"Brand Positioning\",\"Funnel Optimization\",\"Consumer Psychology\",\"Short-form Content Strategy\",\"Conversion Tracking\",\"Conversion API\",\"Campaign Analytics\",\"Content Strategy\",\"Digital Storytelling\",\"Video Editing\",\"Creative Direction\",\"AI-Driven Marketing\",\"Claude AI\",\"ChatGPT\",\"Canva\",\"CapCut\",\"Microsoft Office Suite\"]','[\"Performance Marketer\",\"Digital Marketing Manager\",\"Social Media & Content Manager\",\"Social Media Manager\",\"Growth Marketing Strategist\"]',6.000000,'Bachelor of Business Administration in Marketing','[\"Explicitly stated lack of SQL experience.\"]','The candidate is a strong fit for the Performance Marketer role due to extensive hands-on experience in paid media, proven track record with Meta and Google Ads, expertise in GA4, and clear achievements in optimizing CAC and ROAS. While direct SQL experience is missing, the candidate demonstrates strong analytical capabilities and a data-driven approach. The e-commerce/SaaS scaling experience aligns well with preferred qualifications.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"abeerimtiaj@gmail.com\", \"info@solusbd.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801624657444\", \"+8801626262436\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://linkedin.com/in/abirimtiaj\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"6+ years of paid media experience, exceeding the 3+ years requirement.\",\"Demonstrated hands-on experience with GA4, Meta Ads, and Google Ads.\",\"Proven success in CAC & ROAS optimization, including 14x ROAS achievement and reducing cost-per-sale below $1.\",\"Experience in budget management and independent ownership of paid media operations.\",\"Managed monthly ad budgets across multiple campaigns simultaneously, accountable to clear performance targets.\",\"Strong analytical skills with experience in GA4, GTM, and custom attribution for data-driven decisions.\",\"Experience in scaling monthly revenue (e.g., from BDT 5L to 30L, which implies SaaS or e-commerce context).\",\"Ability to direct full creative production (video, photography, ad copy) and translate into conversion-focused campaigns.\",\"Delivers weekly performance reports with clear insights and actionable changes.\"]'),('a4c8d0df-b52e-4d03-9cc4-be23afbfb93c','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Malik Haider Ali','haider.malik1503@gmail.com','+923150597853','Pakistan','Full Stack Developer',1,'$30k/ yr','https://www.linkedin.com/in/malikhaiderali-ai/','https://www.malikhaiderali.netlify.app','public/full-stack-developer/1779209586789-rfpbty.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\nI build full-stack applications that actually ship. Here’s why I’m the right fit for Dynime:\nWhat I’ve delivered recently:\nReact + Node.js dashboard: Cut load time from 2.8s → 0.9s. Used by 50+ internal users daily.\nPostgreSQL + Express API: Reduced a 4-second query to 80ms with indexing and query rewrite.\nGitHub Actions CI/CD: Deployment failures dropped 60%. Zero downtime in last 3 releases.\nHow I work:\nI debug across the entire stack—frontend, backend, database, and deployment.\nI document what I build so the next dev doesn\'t struggle.\nI ask \"what problem are we solving?\" before writing code.\nYour job requires [e.g., Next.js + MongoDB + Tailwind]. I\'ve used all three in production for 6 month