 a strong fit for this role because I have experience working with international clients in remote environments across business development, customer success, and presales support roles. My background includes client communication, relationship management, CRM coordination, lead follow-ups, and cross-functional collaboration with global teams.\n\nI’m comfortable working independently, managing multiple priorities, and maintaining professional communication standards in fast-paced environments. In addition, my experience supporting business growth initiatives and handling client-facing responsibilities has helped me develop strong communication and problem-solving skills that align well with Dynime’s growth-focused and international work culture.','career-page','interview',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-26 13:31:32','2026-05-28 16:20:02',78,'high','[\"international\",\"b2b\",\"sales\",\"executive\",\"development\",\"growth\",\"remote\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"dynime\",\"relationships\"]','[\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"self-driven\",\"remote-ready\",\"hiring\",\"want\",\"career\",\"drive\",\"careers\"]','Matched 11/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 8y. Maleesha Bandara is a highly qualified candidate with substantial international B2B sales, client management, and remote work experience. Their skills and professional background directly address most of the job\'s core requirements. The only potential concern is the very low salary offered for this level of experience, which should be discussed during an interview. The candidate also indicated \'Negotiable\' for salary, suggesting flexibility. Recommended for an interview.','2026-05-28 12:56:12',5960,'[\"B2B Client Communication\",\"Lead Follow-Ups & Relationship Management\",\"Customer Success & Client Engagement\",\"CRM Management & Documentation\",\"Sa