ted salary.\",\"No specific mention of multilingual abilities, which is listed as \'a plus\' in the job requirements. While \'Strong Written & Spoken English\' is mentioned, other languages are not.\"]','Maleesha Bandara is a highly qualified candidate with substantial international B2B sales, client management, and remote work experience. Their skills and professional background directly address most of the job\'s core requirements. The only potential concern is the very low salary offered for this level of experience, which should be discussed during an interview. The candidate also indicated \'Negotiable\' for salary, suggesting flexibility. Recommended for an interview.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"maleesha.bandara.bd@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+94779268086\", \"+94 77 926 8086\", \"2024-2025\", \"2025-2026\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/maleesha-bandara-80141b18b/\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"8 years of experience aligns well with the \'3+ years experience\' requirement.\",\"Extensive experience in international B2B communication, client relationship management, and sales support, directly matching job requirements.\",\"Proven track record of working independently in remote environments and managing multiple priorities, fulfilling the \'self-driven and remote-ready\' aspect.\",\"Experience in customer success, client engagement, and business development across various industries, demonstrating the ability to \'build client relationships\' and \'drive sales growth\'.\",\"Strong communication and problem-solving skills highlighted, which are crucial for client-facing roles and international teams.\",\"Explicitly mentions working with \'international clients\' and \'global business clients\' in the cover letter and resume, meeting the core requirement of the role.\",\"Background includes CRM coordination, lead follow-ups, and cross-functional collaboration with global teams, essential for the sales executive role.\"]'),('adb9