 typo as 2026 is in the future. The resume also includes a future job duration (January 2025 - December 2025). This needs clarification.\"]','The candidate possesses relevant experience in sales, lead conversion, and team leadership, with a strong background in remote work and international exposure. However, the significant discrepancy in expected salary and the unusual future dates in the experience section require immediate clarification before moving forward.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"piud81456@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801753444610\", \"2023- 2026\", \"01753444610\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/arpita-das-piu-b74a99379?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/arpita-das-piu-b74a99379?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\"]}','[\"6 years of professional experience, including remote work since 2023.\",\"Experience in both the gaming industry (Senior Telemarketing Executive, Team Leader) and education consultancy.\",\"Proficient in customer service, sales operations, lead conversion, and team management.\",\"Demonstrates strong communication, leadership, and operational skills.\",\"Multilingual (Bangla and English) with an IELTS score of 5.5.\",\"Comfortable with remote work and has experience in global settings (Head Office - Malaysia).\",\"Current position as \'Sales and Growth Executive\' aligns with the job title.\"]'),('afcb789e-e73a-408e-b3d0-b27e69ddfaea','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Anas Uddin','anasavik78@gmail.com','+8801701045673','Bangladesh','Logistics and client experience manager',2,'$300 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/anas-avik-107a38274?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app',NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1779655862057-obkdw4.docx','For the past three years, I’ve built one  and operated one  two e-commerce businesses, managing international suppliers, converting leads, retaining clients, and tracking every dollar of margin. No supervisor. No training wheels. Just results. I’m remote ready, self-driven, Adaptable and I know how to build relationships that convert. That’s exactly what this role needs.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 26_3_1 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Mobile/23D8133 Safari/604.1 [FBAN/FBIOS;FBAV/558.0.0.58.74;FBBV/948561885;FBDV/iPhone16,1;FBMD/iPhone;FBSN/iOS;FBSV/26.3.1;FBSS/3;FBID/phone;FBLC/en_US;FBOP/5;FBRV/957194181;IABMV/1]','2026-05-24 20:51:04','2026-05-28 14:26:01',57,'medium','[\"international\",\"self-driven\",\"remote\",\"relationships\",\"drive\"]','[\"b2b\",\"sales\",\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"remote-ready\",\"executive\",\"development\",\"hiring\",\"growth\",\"want\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"career\",\"dynime\",\"careers\"]','Matched 5/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y. The candidate presents a strong case for the role, particularly highlighting self-driven entrepreneurship and relevant skills in lead conversion, client retention, and international business. While direct B2B sales experience isn\'t explicitly named, their e-commerce background with international suppliers and lead conversion strongly suggests proficiency. The candidate\'s self-description aligns well with the \'self-driven and remote-ready\' requirement.','2026-05-24 20:51:18',200000,'[\"international B2B sales\",\"cultural awareness\",\"e-commerce\",\"managing international suppliers\",\"converting leads\",\"client retention\",\"relationship building\"]','[\"Logistics and client experience manager\",\"Sales & Growth Executive\",\"International Sales Executive\"]',3.000000,NULL,'[\"Stated experience in current position is 2 years, but cover letter suggests 3 years of entrepreneurial experie