ipt\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"Web Developer\",\"UI / UX DEVELOPER\",\"Software Engineer\"]',1.000000,'Bachelor In Computer Science Federal Urdu University','[\"Current position listed as \'Ui ux developer\' in application, but professional experience titles in resume are \'Frontend Developer (Intern)\' and \'Web Developer\'.\",\"Experience in resume shows August 2025 - January 2026, which is in the future. This is likely a typo.\",\"Stated experience in the application is 2 years, but resume shows a 3-month internship (May 2024 - July 2024) and another role that is in the future. This suggests less than 1 year of actual professional experience.\",\"Expected salary (70-80k) does not specify currency.\"]','While Rafia demonstrates strong theoretical knowledge and hands-on experience with relevant technologies (React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, API integration), the actual professional experience is limited to a 3-month internship. The applicant does not meet the \'3+ years React + TypeScript\' requirement. Clarification is needed regarding the \'August 2025 - January 2026\' professional experience entry.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"rafiazeeshan214@gmail.com\", \"pakistanrafiazeeshan214@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"03142931931\", \"0314-2931931\", \"2022 - 01\", \"2019 - 03\", \"2007 - 03\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rafia-zeeshan\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://my-portfolio-next-one.vercel.app/\"]}','[\"Experience with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.\",\"Skilled in building responsive and pixel-perfect UIs from design files.\",\"Focuses on performance, accessibility, and user experience.\",\"Collaborated with backend teams for API integrations.\",\"Proficient in writing maintainable and scalable frontend code.\",\"Experience in developing full-stack web applications using React.js, Next.js, Node.js, and MongoDB.\",\"Built responsive and user-friendly interfaces using Tailwind CSS and Chakra UI.\",\"Integrated RESTful APIs for seamless data communication.\",\"Designed reusable UI components using Chakra UI.\",\"Assisted in feature development and bug fixing, improving responsiveness and cross-device compatibility.\"]'),('b3d4d4ff-532a-49c4-93d3-063b2b4d6f3b','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Mohammad Rohan','sabbirhossain01846@gmail.com','+8801646412554','Bangladesh','Social Media Executive at Tutree inc',6,'Negotiable','https://linkedin.com/in/restricted','https://notavailablerightnow.com','public/international-sales-executive/1779640906544-92hh2g.pdf','Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to apply for this position. I have hands-on experience in B2B lead generation, prospect list building, cold outreach, appointment setting, and lead closing. I have worked with multiple companies and clients where I was responsible for finding targeted prospects, conducting outreach campaigns, booking qualified appointments, and communicating with potential clients professionally.\n\nI have worked with companies including Ray Advertising, Cloud Tech Services, Synthron Media, Boyshero, and Tutree Inc. Through these experiences, I developed strong skills in lead research, cold emailing, LinkedIn outreach, CRM management, appointment setting, and sales communication. I also gained valuable experience in lead closing and maintaining client relationships.\n\nI am familiar with tools such as LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Apollo, Google Sheets, CRM platforms, and different outreach tools. I am a quick learner, detail-oriented, hardworking, and capable of working independently while meeting targets and deadlines.\n\nI believe my experience and communication skills would make me a valuable addition to your team. I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nMohammad Rohan','career-page','reviewing',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 14; TECNO CK7