X designs\",\"CRUD operations\"]','[\"Frontend Developer\",\"React Developer\"]',3.000000,'Bachelor of Computer Application (BCA), Lumbini Engineering College, 2017 – 2022','[\"The applicant\'s stated experience (2 years in form, 3 years in CV) does not consistently meet the \'3+ years React + TypeScript\' requirement.\",\"No explicit mention of \'design-systems experience\' in the provided texts.\",\"No explicit mention of \'Web Vitals\' or \'a11y\' understanding.\"]','The candidate presents a strong foundation in React and TypeScript, with relevant project experience and proficiency in Tailwind CSS. While there\'s a slight discrepancy in stated experience years and no direct mention of \'design systems,\' \'Web Vitals,\' or \'a11y,\' the overall skill set makes them a good candidate. Further inquiry during an interview could clarify the missing aspects.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"shambhuchu21@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"9811969388\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shambhu-prasad-chaudhary-620252257/\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"Experienced in ReactJS and TypeScript, with various projects showcasing these skills.\",\"Proficient with Tailwind CSS and demonstrates experience in translating UI designs into components.\",\"Experience in building responsive and high-performance web applications using modern frontend tools like Next.js and React.\"]'),('bd5cb345-f745-437a-91fc-89e456a3ffab','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Tayyab Ahmer','tayyab.ahmer111@gmail.com','+923161208343','Pakistan','Full Stack Developer',2,NULL,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/tayyab-ahmer-6bb016252/',NULL,'public/full-stack-developer/1779286259264-r8j20d.pdf','Hi Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Full-Stack Developer position. While I have two highly concentrated years of professional experience, my daily work is entirely focused on shipping production code using the exact stack you rely on: React, Node.js, PostgreSQL, and Supabase. I thrive in environments where I can take complete ownership of features end-to-end—from designing scalable database schemas to writing performant APIs and deploying reliably to the cloud.\n\nMy recent project work directly aligns with your need for a developer with a strong product mindset who can build and ship features across the stack:\n\nZonic (Business Automation Platform) - Live Demo: zonicapp.com: I engineered this full-stack application end-to-end, utilizing Next.js for the frontend and NestJS with Supabase for the backend. To handle complex messaging workflows and AI-powered scheduling, I designed a queue-based architecture using BullMQ and Redis, ensuring reliable asynchronous processing in production.\n\nTetrad Pay & Vaulex - Live Demo: tetradpay.com: I architected the backend for a digital wallet and transaction monitoring system. This required deep expertise in database design, advanced PostgreSQL query optimization, and writing clean, tested code to handle secure, real-time fund transfers at scale.\n\nI am highly comfortable operating within Agile sprints, utilizing Gitflow, Docker, and GCP to maintain seamless CI/CD pipelines. Working closely with cross-functional requirements has ingrained the importance of daily collaboration, rigorous code reviews, and designing architectures that prioritize user experience and product goals.\n\nI am eager to bring my momentum and deep familiarity with the React and Node/Edge ecosystem to your team. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can immediately contribute to your engineering goals and ship impactful features.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 14:09:24','2026-05-22 09:01:07',85,'high','[\"full-stack\",\"react\",\"node\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"code\",\"features\"]','[\"typescript\"]','Matched 14/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y.','2026-05-20 14:09:38',3449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"tayyab.ahmer111@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+92-3161208343\", \"+923161208343\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tayyab-ahmer-6bb016252/\"], \"portfolio\": []}',NULL),('c045af48-3b13-4da4-a21d-00e7b988790b','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Fahima sheikh','fahimasheikh43@gmail.com','01622354093','Bangladesh',NULL,NULL,'$200 USD / monthly',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; 23129RN51X Build/BP2A.250605.031.A3; wv) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/148.0.7778.178 Mobile Safari/537.36 [FB_IAB/FB4A;FBAV/563.0.0.47.86;]','2026-05-31 09:57:30','2026-05-31 09:57:30',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('c24aac92-4111-4903-865d-15bf203cc041','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Syed Muhammad Umer Naqvi','umernaqvi.1888@gmail.com','+92 3222429895','Pakistan','Frontend developer , Full stack developer',1,'80k','https://www.linkedin.com/in/syed-muhammad-umer-naqvi-94446b284?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_ios',NULL,'public/full-stack-developer/1779267578250-4s27e0.pdf',NULL,'career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 18_7 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Mobile/15E148 [LinkedInApp]/9.32.649','2026-05-20 08:59:41','2026-05-21 16:58:33',39,'low','[\"react\",\"node\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"code\",\"features\"]','[\"full-stack\",\"typescript\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\"]','Matched 8/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has