 role as described.','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"umernaqvi.1888@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/umernaqvi1888\"], \"phones\": [\"+92 3222429895\", \"+92 322 242 9895\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/syed-muhammad-umer-naqvi-94446b284?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_ios\", \"linkedin.com/in/syed-muhammad-umer-naqvi\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"Experience as a Full Stack Developer, contributing to both front-end and back-end features.\",\"Proficiency in React.js and Node.js, directly aligning with the job post\'s tech stack.\",\"Experience in building scalable web applications for a demanding sector (banking).\",\"Demonstrated ability to troubleshoot and resolve technical issues, improving application reliability.\",\"Involvement in end-to-end feature development and code reviews through project work.\",\"Proactive in upgrading legacy systems (Angular migration in \'One Window\' project).\"]'),('c47f5c1d-1270-45d1-8c9d-7d23e01dcd04','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Mohammed Mujtaba','mujtabamohammed730@gmail.com','+92 301 2903039','Pakistan','Software Engineer',4,'1500 / Month',NULL,NULL,'public/full-stack-developer/1779238042163-jwl4y9.pdf',NULL,'career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 00:47:23','2026-05-21 17:29:06',47,'medium','[\"typescript\",\"react\",\"node\",\"stack\",\"technical\",\"code\",\"features\"]','[\"full-stack\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\",\"full\",\"developer\"]','Matched 7/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 4y.','2026-05-20 00:47:40',3633,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"mujtabamohammed730@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"03012903039\", \"+92 301 2903039\"], \"linkedin\": [], \"portfolio\": []}',NULL),('c5954e00-780d-422f-a60f-271d54fc32ac','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Sayma Akter','saymaakter888990@gmail.com','+8801336310815','Bangladesh','Sales executive',1,'$200 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/sayma-akter-a306393a7?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android','https://photos.app.goo.gl/KCxTZfAbbby23Bfa8','public/international-sales-executive/1779683225531-v33vzk.pdf','Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am excited to apply for the remote opportunity at Dynime. As a motivated and growth-driven individual, I am eager to contribute my communication skills, digital knowledge, and strong work ethic to a modern international company like yours.\n\nCurrently, I am pursuing a Bachelor’s degree in Psychology while also completing professional training in Digital Marketing. Through my academic background and practical learning, I have developed strong interpersonal communication, client engagement, problem-solving, and online marketing skills — all of which are valuable for lead generation, client relationship management, and business growth.\n\nI am confident in working with global clients, learning new systems quickly, and adapting to fast-paced remote work environments. I am also familiar with AI tools, online communication platforms, social media marketing, and digital business strategies. My ability to learn fast, stay organized, and communicate professionally allows me to perform efficiently and contribute positively to team goals.\n\nWhat makes Dynime especially appealing to me is your global vision, remote flexibility, and growth-focused environment. I am highly motivated to build a long-term career where I can continuously improve my skills while helping the company expand and succeed internationally.\n\nI am ready to dedicate myself fully, take on responsibilities with confidence, and grow alongside your team. I would truly appreciate the opportunity to prove my abilities and become a valuable part of Dynime.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of speaking with you further.\n\nSincerely,\nSayma Akter','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; V2424 Build/BP2A.250605.031.A3_NN) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/148.0.7778.175 Mobile Safari/537.36 [FB_IAB/FB4A;FBAV/562.0.0.51.73;IABMV/1;]','2026-05-25 04:27:08','2026-05-28 14:25:55',53,'medium','[\"international\",\"sales\",\"executive\",\"hiring\",\"growth\",\"remote\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"career\",\"dynime\",\"drive\"]','[\"b2b\",\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"self-driven\",\"remote-ready\",\"development\",\"want\",\"relationships\",\"careers\"]','Matched 11/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 1y. Despite being under the stated experience requirement, the applicant\'s relevant academic background, digital marketing training, and enthusiasm for remote, global work make them a potential candidate. Their quick learning ability and technical familiarity might compensate for the lack of direct experience. Consider for an initial screening call. Resume could not be parsed.','2026-05-25 04:27:18',0,'[\"international B2B sales\",\"lead generation\",\"client relationship management\",\"business growth\",\"communication skills\",\"digital knowledge\",\"interpersonal communication\",\"client engagement\",\"problem-solving\",\"online marketing\",\"AI tools\",\"online communication platforms\",\"social media marketing\",\"digital business strategies\"]','[\"Sales executive\",\"Sales & Growth Executive\",\"International Sales Executive\"]',1.000000,'Bachelor’s degree in Psychology, Professional training in Digital Marketing','[\"Experience (1 year) is below the stated requirement of 3+ years international B2B sales.\",\"No explicit mention of international B2B sales experience, only \'working with global clients\'.\"]','Despite being under the stat