transaction management, and admin approval workflows, along with designing efficient database structures and features such as receipt generation and payment history.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I have developed several projects that highlight my problem-solving and technical skills. I built a Medicine Demand Forecasting System using Flask, React, and Neural Prophet to predict demand based on sales and weather data. I also developed a Gold Price Prediction model using economic indicators and a backend-focused Backlink Management System using Node.js and Express.\n\nI am particularly interested in roles where I can contribute to building scalable systems, improve backend performance, and work on real-world engineering challenges. I am eager to continue learning and applying my skills in a collaborative and growth-oriented environment.I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nMuhammad Yawar','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-20 19:23:18','2026-05-21 16:58:23',36,'low','[\"react\",\"node\",\"full\",\"stack\",\"developer\",\"technical\",\"features\"]','[\"full-stack\",\"typescript\",\"postgres\",\"supabase\",\"comfort\",\"cloud\",\"mindset\",\"code\"]','Matched 7/15 keywords for \"Full Stack Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 1y. The candidate has a solid foundation in full-stack development, particularly with Node.js, Express, MySQL, and React, demonstrated through professional experience and multiple strong projects. However, they significantly lack the required 3+ years of experience and specific exposure to TypeScript, Supabase, CI/CD, and cloud technologies. While showing potential, they do not meet key requirements for this role.','2026-05-20 19:23:31',2611,'[\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"MySQL\",\"RE