ama\",\"MongoDB\",\"Microsoft SQL Server\",\"PHP\",\"Python\",\"Go\",\"Java\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue.js\",\"Angular\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Terraform\",\"Ansible\",\"Jira\",\"Confluence\"]','[\"Full-Stack Software Engineer\",\"Senior Software Engineer\",\"Software Engineer\"]',5.000000,'BS Computer Science, University of Central Punjab','[\"Submitted resume / CV has dates for his \'current\' role that are in the future: \'10/2025 – 04/2026\' and \'10/2025 – 03/2026\'. This makes it difficult to verify his actual experience and timeline.\",\"Applicant does not explicitly list \'Supabase\' among skills, though \'PostgreSQL\' is present which is the underlying database for Supabase.\",\"Comfort with CI/CD and cloud, while present, is not as explicitly detailed as other requirements.\"]','The applicant shows strong full-stack development experience with React and Node.js, and extensive experience with PostgreSQL and cloud platforms (AWS, Azure), along with CI/CD. The mention of end-to-end product ownership and collaboration with PM indicates a product mindset. However, the future dates listed for current and previous roles are a significant concern and need clarification. Explicit experience with Supabase is not stated, which might be a minor gap depending on the specific use cas','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"moeenahmed690@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/MoeenAhmedCP\"], \"phones\": [\"+92 334-4217072\", \"03344217072\"], \"linkedin\": [\"linkedin.com/in/moeen-ahmed-8906151b5\"], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"5 years of experience specializing in Ruby on Rails, Node.js, React.js, and Next.js, with a strong foundation in scalable backend architecture and modern frontend engineering.\",\"Built and deployed IQniti, a production-grade SaaS platform from scratch on AWS, featuring real-time collaboration via Socket.IO, AI-powered task scheduling with LangChain, Stripe billing, and role-based access across 35+ database models.\",\"Experienced in designing robust REST APIs, optimizing frontend performance, and delivering end-to-end product ownership across startup and enterprise environments.\",\"Skilled in mentoring developers, driving database design decisions, and integrating AI and automation tools to enhance productivity and user experience.\",\"Led the development of a high-performance recruitment platform POC, capable of ingesting and processing thousands of candidate records within seconds, leveraging Ruby on Rails and PostgreSQL.\",\"Engineered advanced search capabilities using PostgreSQL full-text search (tsvector) to enable fast, accurate candidate discovery across large datasets.\",\"Architected and led development of Swaploot, a trading bot platform for CSGO items, engineering WebSocket integrations and scalable backend APIs to ensure seamless multi-site trading experiences.\",\"Spearheaded ExamFit, a corporate wellness survey and test-building platform, optimizing frontend performance with lazy loading techniques and redesigning APIs for faster data retrieval.\",\"Owned the full development lifecycle from backend development, frontend enhancements, database design, deployments, and client communications with minimal supervision for Document Draft.\"]'),('ccf593b8-2b5f-48e3-9261-0345d5b8dd23','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','Muhammad Ali','ak.alikhan.5911@gmail.com','+923021848264','Pakistan','Full stack developer',1,'110k','https://www.linkedin.com/in/ali-khan-mern',NULL,'public/full-stack-developer/1779214608375-ud618c.pdf','Hi, I’m Muhammad Ali, a Full Stack Developer with around 1 year of experience in MERN stack development. I have hands-on experience with React.js, Node.js, Express.js, NestJS, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB. Recently, I worked on CargoPro, a multi-tenant logistics management system, where I contributed to both frontend and backend development. I enjoy building scalable and production-ready applications with clean and maintainable code.','career-pag