.com\"], \"github\": [], \"phones\": [\"+8801759661603\", \"01759661603\"], \"linkedin\": [], \"portfolio\": []}','[\"Applicant explicitly states strong communication and interpersonal skills, which are crucial for sales.\",\"Applicant states being confident, goal-oriented, and motivated to achieve sales targets.\",\"Applicant has 3 years of work experience, matching the job requirement of \'3+ years\' at a base level, though not specifically B2B international sales.\",\"Applicant has experience in Public Relations and management, which could be transferable to client relationship building and coordination.\",\"Applicant is fluent in Bangla and English, with intermediate Hindi, which is a plus for a multilingual environment.\"]'),('d4577443-3744-48a8-a83d-ab897b60f618','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Sharif Ahmed','sharifahmed2070@gmail.com','+923331320083','Pakistan','Frontend developer',2,'$20k , negotiable','https://www.linkedin.com/in/sharifahmed07/','https://sharifahmed-portfolio.netlify.app/','public/frontend-developer/1779263248920-yslgoh.pdf','Hi,\n\nI’m reaching out to apply for the Frontend Developer position and bring immediate value with modern, scalable frontend development.\n\nI’m a Software Engineer with 2+ years of professional hands-on experience in React.js, Next.js, Vue.js, and Nuxt.js, building responsive, high-performance web applications. I specialize in crafting clean UI, managing complex state (Redux, Vuex, Pinia), and delivering seamless user experiences backed by efficient API integration.\n\nIn my current role, I’ve contributed to production-grade applications across fintech and edtech domains—focusing on performance optimization, maintainable architecture, and smooth, intuitive interfaces.\n\nI’d welcome the opportunity to contribute my skills and discuss how I can support your team’s goals.\n\nPortfolio: https://sharifahmed-portfolio.netlify.app\nGitHub: https://github.com/sharifahmed07\n