ipt experience (4 years vs 3+ required), with extensive use of both.\",\"Demonstrates strong experience with Tailwind CSS and building design systems (Material UI, styled-components).\",\"Explicitly mentions \\\"Strong attention to detail\\\" for polish, detail, and responsive behavior.\",\"Clearly understands Web Vitals and a11y, stating it as an \\\"engineering discipline\\\" and applying \\\"Core Web Vitals best practices and a11y standards to every surface.\\\"\",\"Directly addressed all key requirements from the job post, providing specific examples in projects and work experience.\",\"Experience in an agile startup environment, taking end-to-end ownership, and collaborating with product and backend teams.\"]'),('e0173206-ae14-4199-a5bc-b9eb863da1cf','f24794fa-3869-4b31-b0b8-612e3bf9f09c','full-stack-developer','Full Stack Developer','junaid tahir','junaidtahir222@gmail.com','+923026407405','Pakistan','Frontend Developer',6,'$25/year','https://www.linkedin.com/in/junaid-tahir-b199a1137/',NULL,'public/full-stack-developer/1779258164060-af2k4b.pdf','I’m a full-stack developer with strong experience building production applications using React, TypeScript, Node.js, and PostgreSQL-based stacks. I enjoy working across the entire product lifecycle — from designing scalable APIs and database schemas to building polished frontend experiences and shipping reliable features to production.\n\nI’m comfortable collaborating closely with product managers, designers, and engineering teams in fast-paced environments where code quality, performance, and user experience matter. My workflow emphasizes clean architecture, reusable components, maintainable backend services, and writing tested, scalable code that supports long-term product growth.\n\nI also have experience working with modern tooling including CI/CD pipelines, Git-based workflows, cloud deployments, and API-driven architectures.','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_15_7