e world of coding over 3 years ago. I began my journey before the AI surge, forging a solid foundation in problem-solving and building logic from the ground up. This era sharpened my ability to master the deepest technical details and harness modern technologies to build immersive, interactive experiences.\n\nI do not just build websites; I craft integrated digital experiences. My focus is on security, clean code, peak performance, and SEO best practices to ensure your presence is felt at the top. I bridge the gap between aesthetic brilliance and technical power, ensuring your site leaves a lasting impression.','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36','2026-05-19 18:38:00','2026-05-19 18:38:15',86,'high','[\"react\",\"typescript\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"detail\",\"web\",\"vitals\",\"a11y\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"design-systems\",\"attention\",\"understanding\"]','Matched 11/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate is a strong fit for the Frontend Developer role, demonstrating extensive experience with key technologies like React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. Their focus on performance optimization, Web Vitals, and accessibility aligns well with the job requirements. While the \'design-systems experience\' could be clarified, the candidate\'s portfolio and project descriptions suggest strong practical skill in creating reusable UI components, which is a core aspect. The candidate\'s expected salary is also within a reasonable range.','2026-05-19 18:38:14',4428,'[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Next.js\",\"Astro\",\"Redux\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"JavaScript\",\"Framer Motion\",\"Shadcn UI\",\"Material-UI (MUI)\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Vitest\",\"React Testing Library\",\"Jest\",\"Zustand\",\"Context API\",\"Git\",\"GitHub\",\"Vite\",\"Figma\",\"Postman\",\"pnpm\",\"npm\",\"MongoDB\",\"Expre