ity (A11y) compliance in projects.\",\"Strong focus on performance optimization, clean code, and SEO best practices.\"]'),('e2895ed3-700a-4d9c-9e30-0a59a5e56ce9','409d8470-b829-471c-a16a-7db87f6f86b5','ui-ux-designer','UI/UX Designer','Anas Wazir','anaswazir.aw@gmail.com','+923365646937','Pakistan','UI UX Designer',7,'$1200 USD / monthly','https://www.linkedin.com/in/anaswazir/','https://www.behance.net/anaswazir','public/ui-ux-designer/1779450181601-u3fmpl.pdf','Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI’m excited to apply for the UI/UX Designer role. With 7+ years of experience designing SaaS dashboards, web platforms, mobile apps, and marketing experiences, I enjoy turning complex problems into simple, intuitive, and polished user experiences.\n\nI’m highly comfortable working end-to-end — from research, user flows, wireframes, and usability testing to high-fidelity Figma designs and developer-ready handoff. I’ve also worked closely with product managers and engineers, maintaining design systems and making sure designs are both beautiful and practical to build.\n\nWhat excites me about this role is the chance to own product design deeply while also shaping clean, engaging experiences for users. I’d love to bring my eye for typography, layout, accessibility, and interaction design to your team.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I’d be happy to share my portfolio and discuss how I can contribute.\n\nBest regards,\nAnas Wazir','career-page','reviewing',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-22 11:43:03','2026-05-22 13:30:42',78,'high','[\"design\",\"figma\",\"portfolio\",\"typography\",\"designer\",\"technical\"]','[\"shipped\",\"sense\",\"color\",\"motion\"]','Matched 6/10 keywords for \"UI/UX Designer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 7y. The candidate is a strong fit for the UI/UX Designer role based on extensive experience, demonstrated skills, and direct alignment with all sp