uxe Rentals\' is not a developer role.\",\"The expected salary \'Rs. 140,000\' is in Pakistani Rupees, which might be a low conversion if the role is for a different country/currency.\"]','The candidate demonstrates strong technical skills and project experience highly relevant to the role, particularly in modern web development with React, Node.js, and AI integration. While the stated professional experience (1 year) is below the 3-year requirement, their project work, including full-stack AI platform development and a RAG-based legal assistant, showcases practical application of required technologies and a full-stack approach. The \'product-first mindset\' articulated in the cover','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"ali.abdullah.swl10@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/ali-ab-2003\"], \"phones\": [\"+923009690586\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ali-abdullah/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://aliabdulllah.netlify.app/\"]}','[\"Experience building a full-stack AI-powered SaaS platform using React, Node.js, and MongoDB with OpenAI API integration.\",\"Developed a production-ready AI legal assistant using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with Flask REST API backend and React frontend.\",\"Built a HTTP load balancer from scratch using Node.js.\",\"Experience with modern AI frameworks and tools including LangChain, FAISS, OpenAI APIs, and vector databases.\",\"Proactive product mindset, aligning with Dynime\'s stated values. Seeks to build things that real businesses actually use.\",\"Strong technical skills across a wide range of relevant technologies including React, Node.js, PostgreSQL/Supabase (used in projects), TypeScript, Docker, and cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Render, Vercel).\"]'),('eedf8201-0fa3-4f9a-a041-c3332b82ee60','46ef94d8-6652-4d65-a19a-292f916e240f','wordpress-shopify-developer','WordPress / Shopify Developer','Zohaib Hassan','zohaibhassan1573@gmail.com','+923470541523','Pakistan','Wordpress Developer',1,'350$/month','https://www.link