6445216b?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_android\"]}','[\"Applicant has 2 years of professional experience as an Executive Support Engineer and Network Monitoring Engineer.\",\"Applicant possesses strong communication skills, listed in both the cover letter and resume.\",\"Applicant expresses a genuine interest in problem-solving and client interaction, aligning with sales functions.\",\"Applicant has a background in Electronics and Telecommunication Engineering.\"]'),('f1ee65c3-cdb2-4fa2-a1d8-040fc09f46f5','409d8470-b829-471c-a16a-7db87f6f86b5','ui-ux-designer','UI/UX Designer','Tolulope Ajewole','tolulopeajewol@gmail.com','+2348167604838','Nigeria','UI/UX Designer',3,'$2000/month','https://www.linkedin.com/in/toluhdesigns422','https://tolulopeajewoleportflio.framer.website/','ui-ux-designer/1779183400987-yoa6xi.pdf',NULL,'career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 18_6_0 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) CriOS/143.0.7499.151 Mobile/15E148 Safari/604.1','2026-05-19 09:36:44','2026-05-19 17:19:47',40,'medium','[\"design\",\"figma\",\"portfolio\",\"designer\"]','[\"shipped\",\"sense\",\"typography\",\"color\",\"motion\",\"technical\"]','Matched 4/10 keywords for \"UI/UX Designer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y.','2026-05-19 15:43:22',2849,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('f3b38cec-ec73-456b-ba69-b5880d41b747','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Md Sakib Khan','skdesign016@gmail.com','+8801685731063','Bangladesh',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1780179038300-ck2t96.pdf',NULL,'career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-30 22:10:42','2026-06-08 05:59:02',49,'medium','[\"international\",\"sales\",\"growth\",\"want\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"drive\"]','[\"b2b\",\"multilingual