er clients, collaborate with designers and back-end developers to integrate APIs, and optimize websites for performance and cross-browser compatibility. I also provide post-launch support, updates, and bug fixes.\n\nPreviously, I worked at United Software Technologies as a Frontend Developer, where I contributed to scalable frontend solutions, worked on live projects, and strengthened my understanding of component-based architecture and clean, maintainable code.\n\nEarlier, during my experience at Evonicsoft, I built a strong foundation in frontend fundamentals while working on real-world projects.\n\nI am comfortable working with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React.js, hooks, routing, and API integration. I am passionate about continuous learning and delivering high-quality user experiences.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nKind regards,\nMirza Ahmar Baig','career-page','rejected',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-19 21:05:11','2026-05-22 09:01:34',86,'high','[\"react\",\"tailwind\",\"css\",\"attention\",\"detail\",\"understanding\",\"web\",\"vitals\",\"frontend\",\"developer\",\"technical\"]','[\"typescript\",\"design-systems\",\"a11y\"]','Matched 11/14 keywords for \"Frontend Developer\". Required ~3y, candidate has 3y. The candidate is a strong fit for the Frontend Developer position, possessing substantial experience with React.js, Tailwind CSS, and a good understanding of design systems and web performance. While the stated experience is 2.5 years which rounds up to 3 years, they meet all other stated technical requirements and demonstrate relevant project experience.','2026-05-19 21:05:22',3337,'[\"React.js\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"Next.js\",\"jQuery\",\"Bootstrap\",\"SCSS\",\"Responsive Design\",\"Cross-Browser Compatibility\"