es strong technical skills and a proactive learning approach, especially in AI/ML and backend development, the specified frontend experience (React + TypeScript) and overall experience years (1) do not fully align with the job\'s minimum requirements (3+ years). The candidate has experience with React.js and Tailwind CSS but specific TypeScript experience with React is not explicitly detailed. More frontend-focused projects or experience would strengthen the applicat','{\"other\": [], \"emails\": [\"aneddame.contact@gmail.com\"], \"github\": [\"github.com/ara3isc\"], \"phones\": [\"+212639384015\", \"+212 639384015\", \"2022 - 2024\", \"2019 - 2021\"], \"linkedin\": [\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohamed-aneddame/\"], \"portfolio\": [\"https://maneddam.vercel.app/\", \"Portfolio\"]}','[\"Co-built a custom HTTP server in C++ handling 1,000 simultaneous connections with a 99.5% request success rate\",\"Designed and deployed a full-scale multiplayer web platform using Django, PostgreSQL, and a microservices architecture\",\"Built automated AI pipelines combining RAG and Large Language Models to process and structure real scientific research data\",\"Recently completed an internship at UM6P\'s College of Computing, where I built end-to-end LLM and RAG pipelines to extract and structure scientific data for battery material synthesis optimization\",\"Optimized performance, reducing response time by 20% for the HTTP server project\",\"Managed multiple Docker containers effectively using Docker Compose and Docker network\",\"Implemented RAG pipelines with LLMs to extract structured synthesis and characterization data from research papers.\",\"Built ML-ready datasets (inputs/outputs) for battery material synthesis optimization\",\"Automated data preprocessing and ensured reproducibility of extracted datasets\"]'),('ff0d6e42-3d9d-4d31-9f2b-3871c51d9056','15bbb9bd-28a5-414c-b30d-f5e233dd3ce7','frontend-developer','Frontend Developer','Yosef lakew Feyissa','yoseflakewdev@gmail.