h work on end-to-end features and collaboration with PMs and designers.\",\"Experience in developing and maintaining modern UIs using Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui.\",\"Integrated third-party APIs (authentication, payments, external services) and implemented AI-driven features using OpenAI APIs.\",\"Participated in code reviews, technical decisions, and contributed to clean, tested, performant code.\"]'),('ffb4a5a9-1926-4d09-ae0b-7b477b008b1b','b0276011-c8d3-4103-93fc-1e6e71a22509','international-sales-executive','International Sales Executive','Tahiat Samarun','samaruntahiat@gmail.com','+8801618630744','Bangladesh','Freelance - Small Business',2,'$2499 USD / yearly','https://linkedin.com/in/tahiat-samarun-sayshello',NULL,'public/international-sales-executive/1780099896846-m7quzj.pdf','Years of scouting helped me build strong communication and organizational skills, while running my own small business taught me that I genuinely love engaging with people and solving their problems. Recently, I channeled my problems-solving drive into programming by taking Harvard\'s CS50 course. As Dynime is a tech startup, I am eager to bring my resilience and openness to feedback to this role. I want to learn firsthand how a startup operates and handles international clients, and I am confident my mix of business experience and technical curiosity makes me a perfect fit.','career-page','new',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','2026-05-29 13:12:43','2026-06-08 05:59:25',11,'low','[\"international\",\"want\",\"dynime\",\"drive\"]','[\"b2b\",\"sales\",\"multilingual\",\"cultural\",\"awareness\",\"self-driven\",\"remote-ready\",\"executive\",\"development\",\"hiring\",\"growth\",\"remote\",\"grow\",\"global\",\"career\",\"relationships\",\"careers\"]','Matched 4/21 keywords for \"International Sales Executive\". Required ~3y, candidate has 2y.','2026-06-08 05:59:25',577,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N