raffic, engagement, and conversions.',599.000000,'Marketing Tools','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,0,14,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39'),('962cd7d2-f4af-469d-a966-9d7fb39d6f7f','Business Consulting','consulting','Strategic business consulting for startups and growing companies. Growth strategy, operations, and scaling guidance.',999.000000,'Consulting','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791136064-7986c2920216?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,0,22,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39'),('a265ae30-b560-4ddb-907f-ba018ea7bbe5','Analytics & Reporting','analytics','GA4 setup, conversion tracking, custom dashboards, and monthly insight reports to make data-driven decisions.',399.000000,'SEO & Analytics','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,0,16,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39'),('c3998aa2-445e-49fd-a509-78a79a847420','UK Virtual Address','uk-address','Professional London business address with mail forwarding. Use as registered office for Companies House.',99.000000,'Consulting','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513635269975-59663e0ac1ad?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,0,20,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39'),('c8c5a69a-dab2-4a29-863b-178c98f1854f','WordPress Maintenance','wordpress-maintenance','Weekly updates, daily backups, malware scanning, uptime monitoring, and priority support to keep your site secure and fast.',99.000000,'Web Development','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581291518857-4e27b48ff24e?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,0,3,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39'),('d045f5c8-195c-4ca3-b655-37f87248ac30','Social Media Management','social-media','Strategy, content creation, posting, and community management across Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and TikTok.',599.000000,'Marketing Tools','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162