'WooCommerce Development','woocommerce','Complete WooCommerce stores with custom design, payment gateways, inventory management, and shipping integration.',1499.000000,'E-Commerce','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556742049-0cfed4f6a45d?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,1,5,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39'),('f340a7f6-28e6-4cf5-9ea7-03447329c2cf','Page Speed Optimization','speed-optimization','Sub-3 second load times guaranteed. Image compression, code minification, CDN configuration, and Core Web Vitals optimization.',499.000000,'Web Development','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,1,4,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39'),('f6d7ea3f-1b9b-4176-9967-65767132a576','Brand Strategy','brand-strategy','Build a memorable brand. Logo design, brand guidelines, voice & tone, visual identity, and brand positioning.',1499.000000,'Design Assets','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop',1,0,13,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 15:25:15','2026-04-24 15:44:39');
